{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2133eb60a01203186a8bb82ee6cdd1af","RawContent":"Here&#039;s mine, it&#039;s Lia by Melissa Sweet\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b6d709b3127cce8d11a2d573f600000015100Abs3LRi1as2KA\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":11489,"PostDate":1165996014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's mine, it's Lia by Melissa Sweet<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b6d709b3127cce8d11a2d573f600000015100Abs3LRi1as2KA\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"doyouloveit12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1165992742,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206966.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DoYouLoveIt?","Id":206966,"Name":"DoYouLoveIt?","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e037905ece0e9598a0374a924dd5794","RawContent":"Here&#039;s my dress. I tried on about 25 dresses over the course of two weeks and I wound up buying the first one I tried on! How crazy is that!?\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_74845812fa06115c.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_74845812fb42dea9.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n So ladies - what do you think?","Attachments":[],"Id":11623,"PostDate":1166097919,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's my dress. I tried on about 25 dresses over the course of two weeks and I wound up buying the first one I tried on! How crazy is that!?<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_74845812fa06115c.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_74845812fb42dea9.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> So ladies - what do you think?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20070416\/e\/until+my+wedding%21\/dt\/1\/k\/e50d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...e50d\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><br><strong><i>Melissa & MichaelApril 16th, 2007<\/i><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mel_leblanc@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1165840257,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206956.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mel0979","Id":206956,"Name":"mel0979","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45437ba86005d220dec40d5d5e970814","RawContent":"OK well I went to a bridal shop down in Orange County today full prepared to try on my beloved &amp;quot;Scarlet&amp;quot; and possibly buy it (they were offering 10% off because it was the trunk show. So I tried it on and while the dress is still just as beautiful as ever I figured I try on some other gowns just in case. Well this Alvina Valenta dress ended up just being more flattering. PLus it was on sale and was the perfect size and well it was 1\/2 the price too. So I bought it. The pictures don&#039;t look so great - my friend took them with her camera so now I am sudden;y having second thoughts (and ofg course it&#039;s too late because everything is paid for).\n \n Anyway it&#039;s the same alencon lace that Scarlet (among many other dresses) is made with and it has a satin folded ribbon under the bust that is curved which helps make the waist look small. Anyway these pictures are awful - So I am just praying that it looks better in real life:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/Front2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":11918,"PostDate":1166326819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                OK well I went to a bridal shop down in Orange County today full prepared to try on my beloved \"Scarlet\" and possibly buy it (they were offering 10% off because it was the trunk show. So I tried it on and while the dress is still just as beautiful as ever I figured I try on some other gowns just in case. Well this Alvina Valenta dress ended up just being more flattering. PLus it was on sale and was the perfect size and well it was 1\/2 the price too. So I bought it. The pictures don't look so great - my friend took them with her camera so now I am sudden;y having second thoughts (and ofg course it's too late because everything is paid for).<br \/> <br \/> Anyway it's the same alencon lace that Scarlet (among many other dresses) is made with and it has a satin folded ribbon under the bust that is curved which helps make the waist look small. Anyway these pictures are awful - So I am just praying that it looks better in real life:<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/Front2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kashmira & Dan<\/span><br><span>Happily married since June 16, 2007<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/IMG_0769.jpg\">http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l1...a\/IMG_0769.jpg<\/a><br><span>Our mini-video: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html\">http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html<\/a><br><span>Photo slideshow: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php\">http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"gkashmira@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1156793160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206698.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gkashmira","Id":206698,"Name":"gkashmira","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a586b5077d83f6518f92312f74bd39f8","RawContent":"Yup - got the veil too. I am starting to calm down a but - suddenly I was having buyers regret - I guess that happens with big ticket items. Here&#039;s a pic of the top and another one of the back online. I bought mine without the snap on bow train thing but you can get a better idea of the lace and stuff:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/Top.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":11919,"PostDate":1166331682,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yup - got the veil too. I am starting to calm down a but - suddenly I was having buyers regret - I guess that happens with big ticket items. Here's a pic of the top and another one of the back online. I bought mine without the snap on bow train thing but you can get a better idea of the lace and stuff:<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/Top.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kashmira & Dan<\/span><br><span>Happily married since June 16, 2007<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/IMG_0769.jpg\">http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l1...a\/IMG_0769.jpg<\/a><br><span>Our mini-video: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html\">http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html<\/a><br><span>Photo slideshow: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php\">http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"gkashmira@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1156793160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206698.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gkashmira","Id":206698,"Name":"gkashmira","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"491032c1ab839945fdbee6829313ba86","RawContent":"So I went for my first dress fitting today YAY it was so much fun..so here are some pics...this is pre-alterations will post after alterations in a few weeks\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/mydress020.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n original monique lhuillier dress that i was originally going to get but found this similar one for half the price\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/camelot_primary.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n It will be changed into a sweetheart neckline\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/mydress006.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/mydress021.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":17530,"PostDate":1168980468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I went for my first dress fitting today YAY it was so much fun..so here are some pics...this is pre-alterations will post after alterations in a few weeks<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/mydress020.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> original monique lhuillier dress that i was originally going to get but found this similar one for half the price<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/camelot_primary.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> It will be changed into a sweetheart neckline<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/mydress006.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/mydress021.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/ZK9T9734.jpg\">http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l8...k\/ZK9T9734.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"edytalorek@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1154311080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206769.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EDYTA","Id":206769,"Name":"EDYTA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b345d892e2546b1fc45e24f28385cf1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JANET1111&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Jessalyn...that sounds a lot like what I did (buy a Casablanca online and save about $200-$250 off the store price of $750ish). I went through Netbride though, but was just as pleased. Which Casablanca did you choose?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Hi Janet, \n \n I choose style 1831. Here is the link. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jessalyn.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n (I still haven&#039;t figured out how to post a pic in my message....guess I need to read up in the how to section) \n \n I also heard that net bride was a good site. I&#039;m glad that your experience with them was a good one. Sometimes it is hard to know if you should trust an online retailer...especially when it comes to buying something as important as your wedding dress. I&#039;m glad it worked out for both of us. BTW, I think I mentioned this in the thread with your wedding photos, but your dress looked great on you!!","Attachments":[],"Id":18126,"PostDate":1169151992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>JANET1111<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Jessalyn...that sounds a lot like what I did (buy a Casablanca online and save about $200-$250 off the store price of $750ish). I went through Netbride though, but was just as pleased. Which Casablanca did you choose?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Hi Janet, <br \/> <br \/> I choose style 1831. Here is the link. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jessalyn.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> (I still haven't figured out how to post a pic in my message....guess I need to read up in the how to section) <br \/> <br \/> I also heard that net bride was a good site. I'm glad that your experience with them was a good one. Sometimes it is hard to know if you should trust an online retailer...especially when it comes to buying something as important as your wedding dress. I'm glad it worked out for both of us. BTW, I think I mentioned this in the thread with your wedding photos, but your dress looked great on you!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My new man....Donovan<\/span><br><br><span>Wedding photos and avatar by Jonathan Thrasher Photography - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jthrasherphoto.com\">www.jthrasherphoto.com<\/a><br><span>Our wedding slide show <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jthrasherphoto.com\/slideshows\/jessalyn\">www.jthrasherphoto.com\/slideshows\/jessalyn<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/2;54;107\/st\/20090205\/n\/Donovan\/dt\/-3\/k\/27c1\/age.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...k\/27c1\/age.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jessalynj@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1143661800,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206728.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":61,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessalyn","Id":206728,"Name":"Jessalyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd6483a846e349a84e29b02c4ddafc2d","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/a1000.g.akamaitech.net\/f\/1000\/806\/12h\/images.theknot.com\/GownDesigners\/alvinavalenta\/knavalf062669m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n here is the dress Kate was trying to show us all...","Attachments":[],"Id":19148,"PostDate":1169411331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/a1000.g.akamaitech.net\/f\/1000\/806\/12h\/images.theknot.com\/GownDesigners\/alvinavalenta\/knavalf062669m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> here is the dress Kate was trying to show us all...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong>Christine + Will (married 7\/20\/07) + Ainsleigh (born 6\/25\/08) + Nolan (born 11\/9\/10) + Delaney (born 12\/31\/13) = One Very Happy Family!<\/strong>","Email":"christine@dc-hulls.com","IpAddress":"167.154.70.240","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1165971180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206965.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Christine","Id":206965,"Name":"Christine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"965c75c66ff8a94444f1fedfad629b48","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i140.photobucket.com\/albums\/r39\/jessalynj_2007\/IMG_1932.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n So, I took my dress to my BM&#039;s house this weekend and had her take some pics of me in it. For the life of me, I can&#039;t post the pic in the message. I keep getting an invalid file error (and I did try resizing the pic...hmm). Anyway, here is a link to the pic.. hopefully this works. I&#039;m holding the dress in the back because it needs to be altered. And, as mentioned in a previous post, I&#039;m still looking for just the right padded, push-up bra!\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/s140.photobucket.com\/albums\/r39\/jessalynj_2007\/?action=view&amp;amp;current=IMG_1932.jpg\"&gt;IMG_1932.jpg - Image - Photobucket - Video and Image Hosting&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":19761,"PostDate":1169579498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i140.photobucket.com\/albums\/r39\/jessalynj_2007\/IMG_1932.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> So, I took my dress to my BM's house this weekend and had her take some pics of me in it. For the life of me, I can't post the pic in the message. I keep getting an invalid file error (and I did try resizing the pic...hmm). Anyway, here is a link to the pic.. hopefully this works. I'm holding the dress in the back because it needs to be altered. And, as mentioned in a previous post, I'm still looking for just the right padded, push-up bra!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/s140.photobucket.com\/albums\/r39\/jessalynj_2007\/?action=view&current=IMG_1932.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>IMG_1932.jpg - Image - Photobucket - Video and Image Hosting<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam u