ould i change anything about the dress?? i still have one more fitting to go 2...i was thinking of lowering the sweetheart neckline even more, or do u guys think it looks ok?\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/weddingdress004.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":24293,"PostDate":1170899087,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My second dress fitting...had the flowers changed on the dress and had it changed to a sweetheart neckline...here are some pics<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cheesy\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> and sorry for posting my dress twice now...is that allowed<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> btw i want your honest opinion should i change anything about the dress?? i still have one more fitting to go 2...i was thinking of lowering the sweetheart neckline even more, or do u guys think it looks ok?<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i94.photobucket.com\/albums\/l89\/edytalorek\/weddingdress004.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersi