{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2ab562f8bf8644b1896c42a61ca5b2f","RawContent":"In a way, I can agree with Sapphire, in the sense that, for designers, it makes their job a pretty uneasy one. However, if knock-offs were absolutely illegal, David&#039;s Bridal and Davinci Bridal for that matter, would be nonexistent because that&#039;s exactly what most of their dresses are. Look-alikes of designer gowns. I think that if you can have a similar dress made, can&#039;t afford or don&#039;t want to pay the hefty designer price tags, you are in no way obligated to do so. For myself, I don&#039;t think my dress was a knock-off (it&#039;s a Venus Bridal dress), but I also wasn&#039;t about to pay $1000 or up for my dress because if I did I&#039;d be living on the street right now!","Attachments":[],"Id":630257,"PostDate":1237858687,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                In a way, I can agree with Sapphire, in the sense that, for designers, it makes their job a pretty uneasy one. However, if knock-offs were absolutely illegal, David's Bridal and Davinci Bridal for that matter, would be nonexistent because that's exactly what most of their dresses are. Look-alikes of designer gowns. I think that if you can have a similar dress made, can't afford or don't want to pay the hefty designer price tags, you are in no way obligated to do so. For myself, I don't think my dress was a knock-off (it's a Venus Bridal dress), but I also wasn't about to pay $1000 or up for my dress because if I did I'd be living on the street right now!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.photobiz.com\/slideshowbiz\/slideshow.cfm?slideshowID=67327&photographerID=1121\">http:\/\/www.photobiz.com\/slideshowbiz...grapherID=1121<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i430.photobucket.com\/albums\/qq24\/litl_april\/Wedding\/JustMarriedTTD.jpg\">http:\/\/i430.photobucket.com\/albums\/q...MarriedTTD.jpg<\/a><strong>April Marie<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"april_berndt@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1215711677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210454.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":71,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"litl_april","Id":210454,"Name":"litl_april","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"009cb02b4fafd3905b45efd83fd6c33c","RawContent":"In a way, I can agree with Sapphire, in the sense that, for designers, it makes their job a pretty uneasy one. However, if knock-offs were absolutely illegal, David&#039;s Bridal and Davinci Bridal for that matter, would be nonexistent because that&#039;s exactly what most of their dresses are. Look-alikes of designer gowns. I think that if you can have a similar dress made, can&#039;t afford or don&#039;t want to pay the hefty designer price tags, you are in no way obligated to do so. For myself, I don&#039;t think my dress was a knock-off (it&#039;s a Venus Bridal dress), but I also wasn&#039;t about to pay $1000 or up for my dress because if I did I&#039;d be living on the street right now!","Attachments":[],"Id":630258,"PostDate":1237858703,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                In a way, I can agree with Sapphire, in the sense that, for designers, it makes their job a pretty uneasy one. However, if knock-offs were absolutely illegal, David's Bridal and Davinci Bridal for that matter, would be nonexistent because that's exactly what most of their dresses are. Look-alikes of designer gowns. I think that if you can have a similar dress made, can't afford or don't want to pay the hefty designer price tags, you are in no way obligated to do so. For myself, I don't think my dress was a knock-off (it's a Venus Bridal dress), but I also wasn't about to pay $1000 or up for my dress because if I did I'd be living on the street right now!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.photobiz.com\/slideshowbiz\/slideshow.cfm?slideshowID=67327&photographerID=1121\">http:\/\/www.photobiz.com\/slideshowbiz...grapherID=1121<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i430.photobucket.com\/albums\/qq24\/litl_april\/Wedding\/JustMarriedTTD.jpg\">http:\/\/i430.photobucket.com\/albums\/q...MarriedTTD.jpg<\/a><strong>April Marie<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"april_berndt@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1215711677,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210454.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":71,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"litl_april","Id":210454,"Name":"litl_april","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb1e60b3c8f00c4197b67258a50503a0","RawContent":"knockoffs definately arent illegal, like Jacilyn said its only counterfeit things that are illegal since they are claiming to be the designers product when it isnt. Knockoffs are so popular with everything in life so it isnt that bad. I personally am so happy that companies overseas will make a dress knockoff because I dont think a bride should be limited to what she can buy because of price, because I am sorry no wedding dress is worth $10,000 in my opinion so it is best to go with what you want to get and if that is a knockoff than so be it :) as long as it makes you happy and glowing on your wedding day who is to judge? But if you arent comfortable buying one that is totally fine too :) just know its definately not illegal.","Attachments":[],"Id":630299,"PostDate":1237861756,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                knockoffs definately arent illegal, like Jacilyn said its only counterfeit things that are illegal since they are claiming to be the designers product when it isnt. Knockoffs are so popular with everything in life so it isnt that bad. I personally am so happy that companies overseas will make a dress knockoff because I dont think a bride should be limited to what she can buy because of price, because I am sorry no wedding dress is worth $10,000 in my opinion so it is best to go with what you want to get and if that is a knockoff than so be it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> as long as it makes you happy and glowing on your wedding day who is to judge? But if you arent comfortable buying one that is totally fine too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> just know its definately not illegal.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shimmerbabe87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1234925125,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215019.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CaboBride2010","Id":215019,"Name":"CaboBride2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2246796ef6a8db2ca7970000f0c2d093","RawContent":"I&#039;m happy for knockoffs, I love my davids bridal gown! hehe \n serously though cant anyone just be happy saying I look great in my wedding gown? \n \n and if its &amp;quot;illegal&amp;quot; to have knockoffs I would defanatly be in trouble for my 20 pair of knockoff sunglasses and my over 200 bootleg DVDs... dern the military for sending me over seas hehehehe","Attachments":[],"Id":630432,"PostDate":1237875240,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm happy for knockoffs, I love my davids bridal gown! hehe <br \/> serously though cant anyone just be happy saying I look great in my wedding gown? <br \/> <br \/> and if its \"illegal\" to have knockoffs I would defanatly be in trouble for my 20 pair of knockoff sunglasses and my over 200 bootleg DVDs... dern the military for sending me over seas hehehehe\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>[CENTER]<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2010\/03\/05\/cDcN.jpg\">http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2010\/03\/05\/cDcN.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/davf.daisypath.com\/9czLm6.png\">http:\/\/davf.daisypath.com\/9czLm6.png<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span>our webpage<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/timandjenni\">Jenni & Tim<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v331\/Jenamie\/Disneymoon%20Pro\/hjfhhbhy015-1.jpg\">http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v3...hhbhy015-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenamie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1235633668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215276.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":65,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenamie","Id":215276,"Name":"Jenamie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f17a15a93ab775faebb9ffe9a97f91b6","RawContent":"Ahhh this is the thread I&#039;ve been searing for!!!\n \n Everyone who has ordered a knockoff dress can you please post the link to the site where you got it, and tell us if you&#039;d recommend them? \n \n I have a specific dress I&#039;ve been looking for and can&#039;t seem to find it (Paloma Blanca 3802). It&#039;s tough searching for a specific dress since the designer names\/numbers aren&#039;t listed. I&#039;ve flipped through maaaany pages so far and plan to keep looking!!\n Maybe one of you guys can point me in the right direction!\n I don&#039;t want to be &amp;quot;a Paloma bride&amp;quot; i want to be a beautiful bride who isn&#039;t broke because of the dress :)","Attachments":[],"Id":666019,"PostDate":1240519173,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ahhh this is the thread I've been searing for!!!<br \/> <br \/> Everyone who has ordered a knockoff dress can you please post the link to the site where you got it, and tell us if you'd recommend them? <br \/> <br \/> I have a specific dress I've been looking for and can't seem to find it (Paloma Blanca 3802). It's tough searching for a specific dress since the designer names\/numbers aren't listed. I've flipped through maaaany pages so far and plan to keep looking!!<br \/> Maybe one of you guys can point me in the right direction!<br \/> I don't want to be \"a Paloma bride\" i want to be a beautiful bride who isn't broke because of the dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geminigem615@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1231200988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213622.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KimmyG","Id":213622,"Name":"KimmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d27b88140978f66bba44b1b9a4fdfe3","RawContent":"i used zero_love on ebay, she also has a website &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\"&gt;wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal&lt;\/a&gt; I don&#039;t know if she has that specific dress. She didn&#039;t have my specific dress and I contacted her to see if she could do a different dress. She had me email photos of the dress I wanted and she made it! It cost me $190 which included shipping and about 40 days to receive the dress. I DEFINITELY RECOMMEND HER! She was so nice and always responded, maybe not immediately do to time difference but always replied. The dress is PERFECT! I was nervous about doing it but thought for $190 it was worth the risk since the dress normally cost around $900. I ABSOLUTELY love my dress. I say that I recommend her, although my dress doesn&#039;t have any beading or lace so i can&#039;t recommend her as far as that goes. If you want i can post some photos of my dress and the detail in it so you can see her work. I think a couple of other girls have ordered their dresses from her I don&#039;t know if they have them yet or not.","Attachments":[],"Id":666083,"PostDate":1240521833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i used zero_love on ebay, she also has a website <a href='http:\/\/www.landybridal.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal<\/a> I don't know if she has that specific dress. She didn't have my specific dress and I contacted her to see if she could do a different dress. She had me email photos of the dress I wanted and she made it! It cost me $190 which included shipping and about 40 days to receive the dress. I DEFINITELY RECOMMEND HER! She was so nice and always responded, maybe not immediately do to time difference but always replied. The dress is PERFECT! I was nervous about doing it but thought for $190 it was worth the risk since the dress normally cost around $900. I ABSOLUTELY love my dress. I say that I recommend her, although my dress doesn't have any beading or lace so i can't recommend her as far as that goes. If you want i can post some photos of my dress and the detail in it so you can see her work. I think a couple of other girls have ordered their dresses from her I don't know if they have them yet or not.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca72f1f297475988a97a8891753d967f","RawContent":"oh here is your dress from her on the website: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2572.html\"&gt;wedding dress (HS8145)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal&lt;\/a&gt; Its about $236 in US dollars","Attachments":[],"Id":666086,"PostDate":1240522013,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                oh here is your dress from her on the website: <a href='http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2572.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding dress (HS8145)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal<\/a> Its about $236 in US dollars\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afc8a85bcbeec2feb4a0c08002eb90fe","RawContent":"I hear that straps rip pretty easily on the back,as you do have to get it very tight. If you get a dress, just make sure you have the tools to fix it on the day or before,in case it happes.","Attachments":[],"Id":666123,"PostDate":1240523964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I hear that straps rip pretty easily on the back,as you do have to get it very tight. If you get a dress, just make sure you have the tools to fix it on the day or before,in case it happes.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"d@dmitrimarkine.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1239149520,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216553.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dmitri_Markine","Id":216553,"Name":"Dmitri_Markine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"142e1e62521927f984bfb304031165e1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jacilynda&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;oh here is your dress from her on the website: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2572.html\"&gt;wedding dress (HS8145)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal&lt;\/a&gt; Its about $236 in US dollars&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;EEEEEEKKKKK I found it on her site a lil bit ago and have been jumping off the walls with excitement!!! \n \n I came back on here to announce my good news and am excited to see your message, J. You ROCK, Jacilynda, thanks so much for searching for me!!! How the heck did you find it so fast?!?!","Attachments":[],"Id":666149,"PostDate":1240525598,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jacilynda<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">oh here is your dress from her on the website: <a href='http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2572.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding dress (HS8145)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal<\/a> Its about $236 in US dollars<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>EEEEEEKKKKK I found it on her site a lil bit ago and have been jumping off the walls with excitement!!! <br \/> <br \/> I came back on here to announce my good news and am excited to see your message, J. You ROCK, Jacilynda, thanks so much for searching for me!!! How the heck did you find it so fast?!?!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geminigem615@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1231200988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213622.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KimmyG","Id":213622,"Name":"KimmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e050a8b68863cd837bdd4ed1e90022f","RawContent":"ha I don&#039;t know. Her site is nice cause she actually categorizes things by the real designer so I just jumped to other and started looking!\n \n I ordered a standard size from her just because if you order a standard size you can return the dress. It meant alot to me to find someone confident enough in their work that they would do returns. Alot won&#039;t. You would just have to contact them, send the dress back w\/in 7 days. I think she charges a 30% restock fee, but i can&#039;t remember, I think she told me that if you need like a bigger size or something or order another dress they usually wave the restock fee.\n \n I was very concerned about my dress being flimsy and unable to really hold itself up, especially since my mamas are 34DD. But its fantastic. i bought bra cups to add in just to give the mamas a little lift but the dress does the rest, and I can&#039;t even zip it up all the way yet!!! I have to get rid of my big ass!","Attachments":[],"Id":666154,"PostDate":1240525880,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                ha I don't know. Her site is nice cause she actually categorizes things by the real designer so I just jumped to other and started looking!<br \/> <br \/> I ordered a standard size from her just because if you order a standard size you can return the dress. It meant alot to me to find someone confident enough in their work that they would do returns. Alot won't. You would just have to contact them, send the dress back w\/in 7 days. I think she charges a 30% restock fee, but i can't remember, I think she told me that if you need like a bigger size or something or order another dress they usually wave the restock fee.<br \/> <br \/> I was very concerned about my dress being flimsy and unable to really hold itself up, especially since my mamas are 34DD. But its fantastic. i bought bra cups to add in just to give the mamas a little lift but the dress does the rest, and I can't even zip it up all the way yet!!! I have to get rid of my big ass!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6398,"TotalPages":640,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":6390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
