{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92a26125dda4e8e63a67aa5a2a65a3f0","RawContent":"Have you heard any reviews on them? I tried searching for reviews on them and didn&#039;t find any which is fishy to me. Also credible pages always have their accepted forms of payment listed in a small logo on the bottom of their pages and they didn&#039;t have this listed. Did you contact them regarding seeing a pic of the dress before being sent? I didn&#039;t see anywhere on their page where it said they did that. What are their prices? I found another forum that was talking about them but no one had ordered from them there prices were quite high, at least double landy&#039;s prices\n \n Sorry for all the questions. Alot of girls come to this thread looking for someone good and credible to do their dress and these are things to be addressed.","Attachments":[],"Id":685814,"PostDate":1241936114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Have you heard any reviews on them? I tried searching for reviews on them and didn't find any which is fishy to me. Also credible pages always have their accepted forms of payment listed in a small logo on the bottom of their pages and they didn't have this listed. Did you contact them regarding seeing a pic of the dress before being sent? I didn't see anywhere on their page where it said they did that. What are their prices? I found another forum that was talking about them but no one had ordered from them there prices were quite high, at least double landy's prices<br \/> <br \/> Sorry for all the questions. Alot of girls come to this thread looking for someone good and credible to do their dress and these are things to be addressed.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4cc90dcd0709c9442d9c9497b727fd3b","RawContent":"Have you heard any reviews on them? I tried searching for reviews on them and didn&#039;t find any which is fishy to me. Also credible pages always have their accepted forms of payment listed in a small logo on the bottom of their pages and they didn&#039;t have this listed. Did you contact them regarding seeing a pic of the dress before being sent? I didn&#039;t see anywhere on their page where it said they did that. What are their prices? I found another forum that was talking about them but no one had ordered from them there prices were quite high, at least double landy&#039;s prices\n \n Sorry for all the questions. Alot of girls come to this thread looking for someone good and credible to do their dress and these are things to be addressed.","Attachments":[],"Id":685815,"PostDate":1241936134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Have you heard any reviews on them? I tried searching for reviews on them and didn't find any which is fishy to me. Also credible pages always have their accepted forms of payment listed in a small logo on the bottom of their pages and they didn't have this listed. Did you contact them regarding seeing a pic of the dress before being sent? I didn't see anywhere on their page where it said they did that. What are their prices? I found another forum that was talking about them but no one had ordered from them there prices were quite high, at least double landy's prices<br \/> <br \/> Sorry for all the questions. Alot of girls come to this thread looking for someone good and credible to do their dress and these are things to be addressed.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3284d9405e51ee02cf5818c5d72af050","RawContent":"I emailed both the landybridal and duosheng.com yesterday. I got an email right away from dousheng that said they needed to send my ideas to their designer and would get back to me. She did this morning and gave me a quote of $161.95. I&#039;m still going to wait to hear back from the other.","Attachments":[],"Id":686146,"PostDate":1241985050,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I emailed both the landybridal and duosheng.com yesterday. I got an email right away from dousheng that said they needed to send my ideas to their designer and would get back to me. She did this morning and gave me a quote of $161.95. I'm still going to wait to hear back from the other.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"violets@neb.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238941162,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216481.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sugaredviolets","Id":216481,"Name":"sugaredviolets","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0372e01ddf24ca2cf14249de38a69ac1","RawContent":"For those of you who have ordered and received one of these dresses, were there any Brokerage Fees, or Duty when it arrived? If so what were they approx? \n \n I ordered mine a few weeks ago and just got the email saying they shipped it. I want to be prepared when it arrives. Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":686672,"PostDate":1242047047,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                For those of you who have ordered and received one of these dresses, were there any Brokerage Fees, or Duty when it arrived? If so what were they approx? <br \/> <br \/> I ordered mine a few weeks ago and just got the email saying they shipped it. I want to be prepared when it arrives. Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Need an Amazing Photographer? Phil Steingard and his colleagues are great!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.steingardstudios.com\/\">http:\/\/www.steingardstudios.com\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.michaelsteingard.com\/\">http:\/\/www.michaelsteingard.com\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jamiedimitry.com\/\">http:\/\/www.jamiedimitry.com\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"IMPPEARL@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1235228521,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215120.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IMPPEARL","Id":215120,"Name":"IMPPEARL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e5f54eb87d22920e2fb6388631a7969","RawContent":"Zero-Love said they would not do my dress. I was really surprised. Are they just swamped this time of year? Anyway, I went with duosheng and got &amp;quot;best quality&amp;quot;. I&#039;ll post my pics when it arrives.","Attachments":[],"Id":687297,"PostDate":1242076993,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Zero-Love said they would not do my dress. I was really surprised. Are they just swamped this time of year? Anyway, I went with duosheng and got \"best quality\". I'll post my pics when it arrives.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"violets@neb.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238941162,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216481.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sugaredviolets","Id":216481,"Name":"sugaredviolets","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5b58f565572603482a7ddb9a9f2378d","RawContent":"WOW I&#039;