happy with the purchase please hurry and post piccies sooooooooooooonnn thanks a milion maria xx","Attachments":[],"Id":691439,"PostDate":1242325942,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                oh i cant wait i had posted on here that this was the dress i was looking for cos its just so different and like yourself i felt it would make a perfect trash the dress.I wanted to know who the designer was and they were a little secretive so i didnt get to find out and was worried just in case it wasnt as pretty as it looks in the photos.Im glad you are happy with the purchase please hurry and post piccies sooooooooooooonnn thanks a milion maria xx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roo6637@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208337577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209110.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"roo66","Id":209110,"Name":"roo66","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34441933ab06138a7cb46258c58d1753","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width