on Dee as your wedding gown.<br \/> HAHA Jacilynda im loving you think i can rock in this dress at 40 plus xxxx Dee thankyou im so happy xx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roo6637@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208337577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209110.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"roo66","Id":209110,"Name":"roo66","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbd6a75317aebc70612f802c992d745a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;roo66&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;oh i loooooooooooooovvvvvvvvvvvvvvvv it .It looks so well made i can really see this working not only as Dees trash the dress but as my gown too .Oh thankyou for posting in all the excitement i havnt asked what gown did you decide on Dee as your wedding gown.\n HAHA Jacilynda im loving you think i can rock in this dress at 40 plus xxxx Dee thankyou im so happy xx&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I think you would look BEAUTIFUL in it!!! FYI, if you are planning on getting it, it took about a month from the day I ordered the dress to get to me. \n If you have any more questions, let me know!\n My 