it taken it, I would suggest you custom order it so you dont have to get it tailored, and yes it is in white.\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;roo66&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;oh and delivery were tou charged import duty&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I was charged import duty, something like $30 Canadian\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;roo66&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;and last but not least did it arrive wrinkled or as good as it looks hanging up.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thats the way it come, I just hung it up.\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;roo66&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Could you post a pic with you in it thanks maria x&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;The dress is in my parents house in Halifax, Im in Toronto so next time I go back home I will take pics\n \n Hope I answered all your questions, let me know if you have any more","Attachments":[],"Id":693814,"PostDate":1242493479,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>roo66<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Can i please ask is the bottom of the liteinthe box dress as full as the website picture looks,<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>The bottom of the dress is very full, it has a lot of tulle...but it is not as full as the picture shows<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>roo66<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">and what about fit what size did you go with,did you custom order it,ummm you went with the white?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I went with size 14, (Im a street size 12) it came out really big so I have to get it taken it, I would suggest you custom order it so you dont have to get it tailored, and yes it is in white.<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>roo66<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">oh and delivery were tou charged import duty<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I was charged import duty, something like $30 Canadian<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>roo66<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">and last but not least did it arrive wrinkled or as good as it looks hanging up.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thats the way it come, I just hung it up.<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>roo66<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Could you post a pic with you in it thanks maria x<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>The dress is in my parents house in Halifax, Im in Toronto so next time I go back home I will take pics<br \/> <br \/> Hope I answered all your questions, let me know if you have any more\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/NRjNm3\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/NRjNm3\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dawsar83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1233591039,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214537.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":57,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dee83","Id":214537,"Name":"Dee83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53309d6e9caa15f80e182b213f58a19c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KimmyG&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Landy Bridal never responded to my email asking if they could make my dress (San Patrick- Binefar). I found the dress I was looking for at Duosheng. I&#039;m confused though because it only shows photos of the dress and doesn&#039;t have any information about price or ordering it! It&#039;s not from 2009, maybe they don&#039;t make it anymore&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; What do you guys think?\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/CHIC-171.html\"&gt;\u0160\u00b1\u008f\u2014\u00ae\u02c6\u00a8\u008d\u00be\u00b5\u201e\u0160\u00b1\u2030\u0090\u2020\u00b7\u2026\u2020\u00b7\u00be\u0160\u017d&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Just email them with that link. When I ordered, I corresponded with Sabrina [brand9shanghai@gmail.com], she was great.","Attachments":[],"Id":693866,"PostDate":1242496506,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KimmyG<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Landy Bridal never responded to my email asking if they could make my dress (San Patrick- Binefar). I found the dress I was looking for at Duosheng. I'm confused though because it only shows photos of the dress and doesn't have any information about price or ordering it! It's not from 2009, maybe they don't make it anymore<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> What do you guys think?<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.duosheng.cn\/shangweb\/xihun\/CHIC-171.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>\u0160\u00b1\u008f\u2014\u00ae\u02c6\u00a8\u008d\u00be\u00b5\u201e\u0160\u00b1\u2030\u0090\u2020\u00b7\u2026\u2020\u00b7\u00be\u0160\u017d<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Just email them with that link. When I ordered, I corresponded with Sabrina [brand9shanghai@gmail.com], she was great.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"violets@neb.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238941162,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216481.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sugaredviolets","Id":216481,"Name":"sugaredviolets","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b37d4c1718a5b95d3304a123018189e4","RawContent":"Dee thankyou for all the answers to my list of questions.I look forward to seeing you in it.We just got back from our holiday so once the bank balance improves i think ill order it.Plus by then ill know for sure if its the one.What i love about it is its different and if we do the family wedding all the boys can do the green and the girls the pink and im wearing something so out there in terms of its not what anyone will expect.I look forward to all your picsxx","Attachments":[],"Id":693959,"PostDate":1242505352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Dee thankyou for all the answers to my list of questions.I look forward to seeing you in it.We just got back from our holiday so once the bank balance improves i think ill order it.Plus by then ill know for sure if its the one.What i love about it is its different and if we do the family wedding all the boys can do the green and the girls the pink and im wearing something so out there in terms of its not what anyone will expect.I look forward to all your picsxx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roo6637@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208337577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209110.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"roo66","Id":209110,"Name":"roo66","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60a132e7c21d07796f3d5c2e53aa11a9","RawContent":"AHHH, I&#039;m excited! I have bean watching the tracking of my Dress from Shanghai China, and it is almost here!! It was released from customs in Vancouver on Tuesday. This means I should get it any day now! I will post a picture of the actual dress when I get it and let you all know how it turned out. Here is the photo I ordered off of. I saw it on one of those dress shows and couldn&#039;t stop thinking about it. I did order it custom but I also have the zipper changed to a corset back. I figured this would give me a better chance of it fitting. I am only ordering it for my TTD I only spent like $90 for it so works case I&#039;m not out much and I should be able to use it for TTD anyway.\n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i681.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv175\/IMPPEARL\/TTD.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":699656,"PostDate":1243000449,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                AHHH, I'm excited! I have bean watching the tracking of my Dress from Shanghai China, and it is almost here!! It was released from customs in Vancouver on Tuesday. This means I should get it any day now! I will post a picture of the actual dress when I get it and let you all know how it turned out. Here is the photo I ordered off of. I saw it on one of those dress shows and couldn't stop thinking about it. I did order it custom but I also have the zipper changed to a corset back. I figured this would give me a better chance of it fitting. I am only ordering it for my TTD I only spent like $90 for it so works case I'm not out much and I should be able to use it for TTD anyway.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i681.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv175\/IMPPEARL\/TTD.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Need an Amazing Photographer? Phil Steingard and his colleagues are great!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.steingardstudios.com\/\">http:\/\/www.steingardstudios.com\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.michaelsteingard.com\/\">http:\/\/www.michaelsteingard.com\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jamiedimitry.com\/\">http:\/\/www.jamiedimitry.com\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"IMPPEARL@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1235228521,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215120.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IMPPEARL","Id":215120,"Name":"IMPPEARL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0b7e4ecfc5fdcc46b96e05f90b416d1","RawContent":"IMPPEARL--forgive me if you already said, but I couldn&#039;t find it--when you post pics would you also say what company you used, please. Can&#039;t wait to see it.\n I&#039;ve seen similar dresses on &amp;quot;Say Yes To The Dress&amp;quot;, love that show! But they don&#039;t have anything for $90, haha.","Attachments":[],"Id":699784,"PostDate":1243006379,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                IMPPEARL--forgive me if you already said, but I couldn't find it--when you post pics would you also say what company you used, please. Can't wait to see it.<br \/> I've seen similar dresses on \"Say Yes To The Dress\", love that show! But they don't have anything for $90, haha.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/PpH3m5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"violets@neb.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238941162,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216481.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sugaredviolets","Id":216481,"Name":"sugaredviolets","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9e252a8d5d0d2721825d7067679b913","RawContent":"Just a head&#039;s up...\n \n I&#039;m working with these peeps for my TTD. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/stores.shop.ebay.com\/gianinarbridal__W0QQ_armrsZ1\"&gt;http:\/\/stores.shop.ebay.com\/gianinar...__W0QQ_armrsZ1&lt;\/a&gt; Their Ebay feedback is insanely good (almost 100% with close to 2,000 dresses made!) and they get rave reviews. The response time was great (within 24hrs) to my inquiry, and get this; they actually allow you to order your dress production with only half down. THEN, they send you photos, of the actual dress they have made you and leave it up to you whether you think it&#039;s worth completing the purchase!\n \n For a Maggie knock off gown that&#039;s retailing at $1600 to be replicated, they are charging me $100, plus $59 shipping to the U.S. I can&#039;t NOT try &#039;em out for that price! I looked a long time before deciding to try one of the overseas manufacturers because even while it&#039;s not a lot of money, I don&#039;t want to waste it and end up with something I won&#039;t use even for the TTD. Those pics are important!\n \n I&#039;ll definitely post when they send me the dress pics.","Attachments":[],"Id":700297,"PostDate":1243050751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just a head's up...<br \/> <br \/> I'm working with these peeps for my TTD. <a href='http:\/\/stores.shop.ebay.com\/gianinarbridal__W0QQ_armrsZ1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/stores.shop.e....__W0QQ_armrsZ1<\/a> Their Ebay feedback is insanely good (almost 100% with close to 2,000 dresses made!) and they get rave reviews. The response time was great (within 24hrs) to my inquiry, and get this; they actually allow you to order your dress production with only half down. THEN, they send you photos, of the actual dress they have made you and leave it up to you whether you think it's worth completing the purchase!<br \/> <br \/> For a Maggie knock off gown that's retailing at $1600 to be replicated, they are charging me $100, plus $59 shipping to the U.S. I can't NOT try 'em out for that price! I looked a long time before deciding to try one of the overseas manufacturers because even while it's not a lot of money, I don't want to waste it and end up with something I won't use even for the TTD. Those pics are important!<br \/> <br \/> I'll definitely post when they send me the dress pics.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Savannah<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/i17.photobucket.com\/albums\/b85\/QuadMom\/Kids1linecollage.jpg'>http:\/\/i17.photobucket.com\/albums\/b8...inecollage.jpg<\/a><strong class='bbc'>The Fab Four (my quads) Meryn, Kellen, Nico & Layla<\/strong><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt265ad.aspx'>http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt265ad.aspx<\/a><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/williamandsavannah\/index.html'>http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/williamandsavannah\/index.html<\/a><strong class='bbc'>20 STD's w. pre-lim RSVP sent 6\/15\/09: 7 \"Yes\" so far\/10 guests total!<\/strong>","Email":"savvy1120@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1190575920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207776.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":99,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BillysBride","Id":207776,"Name":"BillysBride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6398,"TotalPages":640,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":6390},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
