282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                WOW!!! I am now thinking what label do I get!!! I found a picture of a couple dresses online and I have taken them to this lovely lady to have her make \"My Dress\" Top of the dress is one designer and bottom another... what laws have I broken thief, counterfit,fraud!!!! I just want the dress of my dreams and I really don't think it is that big of a deal.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i828.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz204\/suevanderwouw\/th_Picture172.jpg\">http:\/\/i828.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...Picture172.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sue.sparkes@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1251183956,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220920.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SusieQ","Id":220920,"Name":"SusieQ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7fb93b23501f18d2570cea49047fa1d","RawContent":"Im pretty sure Im ordering through &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\"&gt;wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal&lt;\/a&gt; as well. She can get a custom dress to me, but its cutting it super close. Im afriad to close, and I havent tried this style on, the designer I have, but not the style. So that does worry me a bit. Ive been looking on her site, because she can really rush those but cant decide! I know I want lace....but so many choices!","Attachments":[],"Id":848903,"PostDate":1253207211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Im pretty sure Im ordering through <a href='http:\/\/www.landybridal.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal<\/a> as well. She can get a custom dress to me, but its cutting it super close. Im afriad to close, and I havent tried this style on, the designer I have, but not the style. So that does worry me a bit. Ive been looking on her site, because she can really rush those but cant decide! I know I want lace....but so many choices!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cajaya@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1210010430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209276.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SgtPepperette","Id":209276,"Name":"SgtPepperette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted