ors, bronzes work best for me. Hair will have extensions and be pinned loosley<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/106457dfd1fdd925.bmp\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/106457dfd1feb3e1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><center><\/span><br><br><span>Jenetta - JPMO<\/span><br><br><span>Dreams Resort June 16th, 2007<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20070616\/e\/Our+Wedding+Day%21%21%21\/dt\/-1\/k\/114e\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...114e\/event.png<\/a><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/\">http:\/\/pregnancy.baby-gaga.com\/<\/a><span>\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png\">http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev065br___.png<\/a><span>\" alt=\"pregnant\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a>[link=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/%5D%5Bimage\">http:\/\/www.baby-gaga.com\/][image<\/a><span> noborder]<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/t\/dogdogcrd20080310_-8_Maurice+Sean.png%5B\/image%5D%5B\/link%5D\">http:\/\/tick...<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msjlpolk@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1142540820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206725.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JPMO","Id":206725,"Name":"JPMO","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"363761de491c8b722f513ad6f0add810","RawContent":"Here was the a picture from my trial by my stylist at home. I wanted little flowers too (as you can see in the photo). But Maye ended up ordering me GIGANTIC flowers, so I could only use one. Another thing I should have confirmed the day before.\n \n These were taken from a camera phone, so the quality isn&#039;t all that good.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g115\/rebeccaohara\/MyHair-Back.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g115\/rebeccaohara\/Hairflowerside.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g115\/rebeccaohara\/Myhair-Side.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":11400,"PostDate":1165963851,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here was the a picture from my trial by my stylist at home. I wanted little flowers too (as you can see in the photo). But Maye ended up ordering me GIGANTIC flowers, so I could only use one. Another thing I should have confirmed the day before.<br \/> <br \/> These were taken from a camera phone, so the quality isn't all that good.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g115\/rebeccaohara\/MyHair-Back.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g115\/rebeccaohara\/Hairflowerside.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g115\/rebeccaohara\/Myhair-Side.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Rebecca<\/span><br><span><center><\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g115\/rebeccaohara\/IMG_1294.jpg\">http:\/\/i54.photobucket.com\/albums\/g1...a\/IMG_1294.jpg<\/a><br><i>Alexander & Juliette - Born 3\/15\/09<\/i><span><\/center><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rebeccalynne2003@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1137386220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206708.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":88,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"REBECCA","Id":206708,"Name":"REBECCA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"Tot