ideshow: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.juancarlostapia.com\/sarah18\/index.html\">http:\/\/www.juancarlostapia.com\/sarah18\/...<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sarah_p376@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1149557340,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206741.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BEACHBRIDEMA","Id":206741,"Name":"BEACHBRIDEMA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3efafc123ed8e4f93ac7140b9c868106","RawContent":"These were some ideas I had. I&#039;m keeping my makeup and accessories simple, so I&#039;d like my hair to &amp;quot;match&amp;quot;. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i177.photobucket.com\/albums\/w225\/springbride_2007\/updo4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt; \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i177.photobucket.com\/albums\/w225\/springbride_2007\/updo5.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i177.photobucket.com\/albums\/w225\/springbride_2007\/updo3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i177.photobucket.com\/albums\/w225\/springbride_2007\/updo2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":20116,"PostDate":1169671738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                These were some ideas I had. I'm keeping my makeup and accessories simple, so I'd like my hair to \"match\". <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i177.photobucket.com\/albums\/w225\/springbride_2007\/updo4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i177.photobucket.com\/albums\/w225\/springbride_2007\/updo5.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i177.photobucket.com\/albums\/w225\/springbride_2007\/updo3.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i177.photobucket.com\/albums\/w225\/springbride_2007\/updo2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;21;25\/st\/20070503\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Phil%27s+Wedding\/dt\/2\/k\/3d39\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...3d39\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jennfollett@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1153936856,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206767.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SPRINGBRIDE","Id":206767,"Name":"SPRINGBRIDE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7772151921909225792d8abd2a5c44fb","RawContent":"I just learned how to post a pic last night! So, I hear ya (but I had my setting wrongs, so I couldn&#039;t even see the smilies)!\n \n Anyway, now that I can post pics, here are a couple of hair ideas I&#039;ve saved. I like the first one best.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i140.photobucket.com\/albums\/r39\/jessalynj_2007\/hairidea2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i140.photobucket.com\/albums\/r39\/jessalynj_2007\/hairideacopy.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":20242,"PostDate":1169687937,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just learned how to post a pic last night! So, I hear ya (but I had my setting wrongs, so I couldn't even see the smilies)!<br \/> <br \/> Anyway, now that I can post pics, here are a couple of hair ideas I've saved. I like the first one best.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i140.photobucket.com\/albums\/r39\/jessalynj_2007\/hairidea2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i140.photobucket.com\/albums\/r39\/jessalynj_2007\/hairideacopy.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My new man....Donovan<\/span><br><br><span>Wedding photos and avatar by Jonathan Thrasher Photography - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jthrasherphoto.com\">www.jthrasherphoto.com<\/a><br><span>Our wedding slide show <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jthrasherphoto.com\/slideshows\/jessalyn\">www.jthrasherphoto.com\/slideshows\/jessalyn<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/2;54;107\/st\/20090205\/n\/Donovan\/dt\/-3\/k\/27c1\/age.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...k\/27c1\/age.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jessalynj@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1143661800,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206728.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":61,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessalyn","Id":206728,"Name":"Jessalyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d009bded987e02a0a16c5fd1bfd6cf7","RawContent":"I came across a few more styles that I like. I know my hair won&#039;t hold the curl in the 2nd set, but I love, and if your hair will hold curl, well you might like it. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/24445bcf4d6b2b4c.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/24445bcf4d707230.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/24445bcf4d719af1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n FI asked me last night what we were talking about on the board, and when I said hair - his only comments was &amp;quot;all up is not good&amp;quot; - so apparently, that is off the table for me as an option.... I really wanted up. O&#039;well.","Attachments":[],"Id":21116,"PostDate":1170015070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I came across a few more styles that I like. I know my hair won't hold the curl in the 2nd set, but I love, and if your hair will hold curl, well you might like it. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/24445bcf4d6b2b4c.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/24445bcf4d707230.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/24445bcf4d719af1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> FI asked me last night what we were talking about on the board, and when I said hair - his only comments was \"all up is not good\" - so apparently, that is off the table for me as an option.... I really wanted up. O'well.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Stephanie & Jason ~ RIU Palace ~ Cabo San Lucas<\/span><br><span>June 23, 2007<\/span><br><span>Visit our wedding slideshow <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bajaimagebank.com\/Portfolio\/StephanieJason\/index.html\">Stephanie & Jason<\/a><br><span>Photography by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bajaimagebank.com\/index.html\">Jose \"Pepe\" Lima<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"pugliess@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1152827700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206762.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":93,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RAENJAY","Id":206762,"Name":"RAENJAY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67b5d3b748b12dc7c32abb5098e35ea0","RawContent":"for those of you with really curly hair - i just thought i&#039;d share this Knot Bio\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/talk.theknot.com\/boards\/User\/Profile.aspx?bioname=curlyhairbio\"&gt;The Knot Forums&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":34108,"PostDate":1173749664,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                for those of you with really curly hair - i just thought i'd share this Knot Bio<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/talk.theknot.com\/boards\/User\/Profile.aspx?bioname=curlyhairbio' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>The Knot Forums<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161378480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8cc3d163dec57ad50651c0e9f663af4","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_58445f609073dd77.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_58445f608f6eeb42.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I LOVE this style (hair, make-up, dress) Can someone make me look like this&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":34113,"PostDate":1173752130,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_58445f609073dd77.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_58445f608f6eeb42.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> I LOVE this style (hair, make-up, dress) Can someone make me look like this<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Photo by <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog'>www.monicamartinphotography.com\/blog<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/amyhs-planning-galore-24132\/index10.html'>Planning Pics!<\/a> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/amyhs-puerto-vallarta-wedding-more-review-works-25255\/index4.html'>PV and Wedding Review<\/a><strong class='bbc'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures?authkey=w0DgS3ao1sI#'>Pro Pics (1)<\/a>; <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/amyhmartin\/ProfessionalWeddingPictures2?authkey=vbG3xUMVk1s#'>Pro Pics (2)<\/a><\/strong> <strong class='bbc'>By Nataly Lemus Photography and Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/strong> <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/natalylemusphoto.blogspot.com\/2008\/07\/amy-hanssel-married.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Nataly Lemus Photogaphy<\/a><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.arpiaphotoblog.com\/2008\/07\/puerto-vallarta-destination-wedding_3102.html'>Teaser Pro Pics from Rodolfo Arpia Photography<\/a>","Email":"amyhmartin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.119.192.139","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1162157640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206875.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amyh","Id":206875,"Name":"amyh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a01feb8096a0df3dfc42aa1801b4dcf6","RawContent":"Thought I would bring this post back to life a little.... not that the pics werent beautiful, just wanting more ideas. I love this hair style, just dont know how hard it would be to do it on my own.... any suggestions hair stylists&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":127720,"PostDate":1192867343,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thought I would bring this post back to life a little.... not that the pics werent beautiful, just wanting more ideas. I love this hair style, just dont know how hard it would be to do it on my own.... any suggestions hair stylists<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i214.photobucket.com\/albums\/cc237\/kevinsbride\/hair.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j302\/snarnold\/thegirls-2.jpg\">http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j3...thegirls-2.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;128\/st\/20080607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/66ac\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...66ac\/event.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j302\/snarnold\/ferret2.jpg\">http:\/\/i83.photobucket.com\/albums\/j3...ld\/ferret2.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sarah.arnold@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1187543002,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207643.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":82,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Saraha","Id":207643,"Name":"Saraha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43392741d1856eeceb3decc946aee34d","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Well, since my other laptop died, I lost all the friggin&#039; hair ideas that I had worked so many months to save. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n So I am trying to re-assess my hair options. Lots of the pics in this thread are showing up as &#039;x&#039; for me, which is a bummer ... but I&#039;m starting to get some new ideas and find some of the same ideas I had saved prior.\n \n Lots of new ladies on BDW lately, so keep this thread rolling and add some of your fave hair and\/or make-up ideas.\n \n I keep going back to this one for hair...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hairupdo.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n But I also like this ... although it might be awfully formal for a beach wedding ... with little chance of staying in place, perhaps.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair_updo_8n.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair_updo_2n.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And of course, Edyta&#039;s hair is an all-time favorite. I am just afraid it wouldn&#039;t hold it&#039;s shape b\/c my hair is so thin...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair10.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":202244,"PostDate":1203630333,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bump.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bump\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Well, since my other laptop died, I lost all the friggin' hair ideas that I had worked so many months to save. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> So I am trying to re-assess my hair options. Lots of the pics in this thread are showing up as 'x' for me, which is a bummer ... but I'm starting to get some new ideas and find some of the same ideas I had saved prior.<br \/> <br \/> Lots of new ladies on BDW lately, so keep this thread rolling and add some of your fave hair and\/or make-up ideas.<br \/> <br \/> I keep going back to this one for hair...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hairupdo.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> But I also like this ... although it might be awfully formal for a beach wedding ... with little chance of staying in place, perhaps.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair_updo_8n.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair_updo_2n.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And of course, Edyta's hair is an all-time favorite. I am just afraid it wouldn't hold it's shape b\/c my hair is so thin...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair10.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/Slide1-7.jpg\">http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...v\/Slide1-7.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"scwinetastings@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177642740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207379.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"foxytv","Id":207379,"Name":"foxytv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":994,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e0e0049aa9ffc89725d7702734ca3fc","RawContent":"This link has lots of pics in a portfolio (updo&#039;s at the top, then half-up\/half-down and all down near the bottom). &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I also found this:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair7.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair8.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":202332,"PostDate":1203634237,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This link has lots of pics in a portfolio (updo's at the top, then half-up\/half-down and all down near the bottom). <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/hair6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresi