{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":17,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":655,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1887816,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1435421499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"StartDate":1425136624,"LastPoster":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1887816,"PostDate":1425136624,"PostContent":"So... I have a challenge.\u00a0 My fiance does not want a wedding band, but for a pretty good reason.\u00a0...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424042509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1435421499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79ee207e2b9a18569acb3cfcd664a73d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So... I have a challenge.&amp;nbsp; My fiance does not want a wedding band, but for a pretty good reason.&amp;nbsp; He once broke his finger and did not see a doctor (stubborn man).&amp;nbsp; As a result his ring finger healed in a permanently bent position.&amp;nbsp; There is no flex at all. On top of that he is a Automotive Technician, so no rings allowed at work.&amp;nbsp; I told him I don&#039;t care if he doesn&#039;t wear a ring day to day, but it is important to me that he at least wear one for the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; I have no idea how this is going to work out.&amp;nbsp; He says he wants a \"wedding watch\" which I just scoffed at, because he just wants to feed his watch addiction.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s important to me that he have the ring if not to wear, as a symbol of our marriage.&amp;nbsp; So what do you ladies think would be better, a ring that&#039;s a couple of sizes too big just to get it on his paws during the ceremony?&amp;nbsp; Or a regular sized ring to be worn on the right hand?&amp;nbsp; Has anyone ever encountered this kind of problem?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s the finger!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i.imgur.com\/2LYJ2RQ.jpg\" alt=\"2LYJ2RQ.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887816,"PostDate":1425136624,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So... I have a challenge.\u00a0 My fiance does not want a wedding band, but for a pretty good reason.\u00a0 He once broke his finger and did not see a doctor (stubborn man).\u00a0 As a result his ring finger healed in a permanently bent position.\u00a0 There is no flex at all. On top of that he is a Automotive Technician, so no rings allowed at work.\u00a0 I told him I don't care if he doesn't wear a ring day to day, but it is important to me that he at least wear one for the ceremony.\u00a0 I have no idea how this is going to work out.\u00a0 He says he wants a \"wedding watch\" which I just scoffed at, because he just wants to feed his watch addiction.\u00a0 It's important to me that he have the ring if not to wear, as a symbol of our marriage.\u00a0 So what do you ladies think would be better, a ring that's a couple of sizes too big just to get it on his paws during the ceremony?\u00a0 Or a regular sized ring to be worn on the right hand?\u00a0 Has anyone ever encountered this kind of problem?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's the finger!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i.imgur.com\/2LYJ2RQ.jpg\" alt=\"2LYJ2RQ.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424042509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1435421499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.28.245.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"061462cdd5f8e6cf315cec2335f7a81f","RawContent":"My husband (almost said fianc\u00e9) can&#039;t wear his ring at work either but does like to wear it on the weekend. \n\n\nIf it was me, I would get him one a couple sizes to big to go over his knuckle.   If you didn&#039;t think he&#039;d wear it often I would buy a cheapy.  Tungsten styles can be under $100. They aren&#039;t the nicest of their brand\/styles but hey! If he won&#039;t wear it often anyways. \n\n\nNever heard of a wedding watch!! Men and their ideas hehe\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1887822,"PostDate":1425145468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My husband (almost said fianc\u00e9) can't wear his ring at work either but does like to wear it on the weekend. <br><br>\nIf it was me, I would get him one a couple sizes to big to go over his knuckle.   If you didn't think he'd wear it often I would buy a cheapy.  Tungsten styles can be under $100. They aren't the nicest of their brand\/styles but hey! If he won't wear it often anyways. <br><br>\nNever heard of a wedding watch!! Men and their ideas hehe<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5ca77027054fe5ddadd2e3f3b018017","RawContent":"@[member=\"JoannaBanana\"] I thought I was the only bride who has encountered a fianc\u00e9 who wants a \"wedding watch\". I read your post out loud to him and his reply, \"I like her fianc\u00e9, he&#039;s a smart man\". He&#039;s in construction do also can&#039;t wear a ring at work but I told him that i want him to still wear a ring because of what it stands for. Plus, I&#039;d like to exchange rings during the ceremony, not slip a watch on her wrist! He can&#039;t wear any jewellery at all to work so that argument won&#039;t work for me!\n\n\nWe don&#039;t quite have the same problem as you with the ring finger so we&#039;ve agreed to get a ring, just one that&#039;s not super expensive. We still have to go get rings do not sure what he&#039;ll choose. As a surprise, I am getting him a watch as a wedding present. I&#039;ll have my nephew bring it to his room before the ceremony and I&#039;ll have a tag on it that will say, \"I can&#039;t wait to see you at 3:00, when we officially become husband and wife\".","Attachments":[],"Id":1887834,"PostDate":1425151600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282128\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282128-joannabanana\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JoannaBanana<\/span><\/a> I thought I was the only bride who has encountered a fianc\u00e9 who wants a \"wedding watch\". I read your post out loud to him and his reply, \"I like her fianc\u00e9, he's a smart man\". He's in construction do also can't wear a ring at work but I told him that i want him to still wear a ring because of what it stands for. Plus, I'd like to exchange rings during the ceremony, not slip a watch on her wrist! He can't wear any jewellery at all to work so that argument won't work for me!<br><br>\nWe don't quite have the same problem as you with the ring finger so we've agreed to get a ring, just one that's not super expensive. We still have to go get rings do not sure what he'll choose. As a surprise, I am getting him a watch as a wedding present. I'll have my nephew bring it to his room before the ceremony and I'll have a tag on it that will say, \"I can't wait to see you at 3:00, when we officially become husband and wife\".\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd473b9a360b743eeb304c529a3655eb","RawContent":"@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] Yes he says \"it&#039;s still a circle.\"  He has made it clear that he wants a watch for his wedding present.   I keep telling him he&#039;s dreaming but if I can muster up the money then he&#039;ll get his \"wedding watch.\"","Attachments":[],"Id":1887838,"PostDate":1425154864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> Yes he says \"it's still a circle.\"  He has made it clear that he wants a watch for his wedding present.   I keep telling him he's dreaming but if I can muster up the money then he'll get his \"wedding watch.\"\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424042509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1435421499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.53.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f00f0c47ca555a4eaf0b0802e26e4c4","RawContent":"He wants a watch for his reasons you want a ring for your reasons lol! Get them both! I know $ doesn&#039;t grow on trees but maybe save a little here and there and get him a watch for a wedding gift and also a simple band for the ceremony. He could wear a proper fitting ring on his right hand during the ceremony. It doesn&#039;t have to be on his left hand to be meaningful. But yes no rings around machinery! Very dangerous! \nP.S. We are honoring our children in ceremony with a watch and a bracelet everybody gonna get a watch! Haha","Attachments":[],"Id":1887867,"PostDate":1425211069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                He wants a watch for his reasons you want a ring for your reasons lol! Get them both! I know $ doesn't grow on trees but maybe save a little here and there and get him a watch for a wedding gift and also a simple band for the ceremony. He could wear a proper fitting ring on his right hand during the ceremony. It doesn't have to be on his left hand to be meaningful. But yes no rings around machinery! Very dangerous! <br \/>P.S. We are honoring our children in ceremony with a watch and a bracelet everybody gonna get a watch! Haha\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401122033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f46dbe62115dc84a8797c3f95f410e4","RawContent":"I agree Lisa, that&#039;s my plan.  Squirrel away some money and try to figure out which watch it is that he wants.","Attachments":[],"Id":1887869,"PostDate":1425211728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree Lisa, that's my plan.  Squirrel away some money and try to figure out which watch it is that he wants.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424042509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1435421499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.53.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43495159c81ee2ea762090b057ac6d9c","RawContent":"Good luck! I hope it turns out great","Attachments":[],"Id":1887871,"PostDate":1425212242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good luck! I hope it turns out great\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401122033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8384d85330243d4e9f5b0e1ad0b1feeb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LisaAnthonyPoppy\" post=\"1887867\" timestamp=\"1425225469\"]\nHe wants a watch for his reasons you want a ring for your reasons lol! Get them both! I know $ doesn&#039;t grow on trees but maybe save a little here and there and get him a watch for a wedding gift and also a simple band for the ceremony. He could wear a proper fitting ring on his right hand during the ceremony. It doesn&#039;t have to be on his left hand to be meaningful. But yes no rings around machinery! Very dangerous! P.S. We are honoring our children in ceremony with a watch and a bracelet everybody gonna get a watch! Haha[\/quote]\nI love that you&#039;re honoring your children during your ceremony! absolutely love it!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887883,"PostDate":1425217834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LisaAnthonyPoppy, on 01 March 2015 - 11:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>He wants a watch for his reasons you want a ring for your reasons lol! Get them both! I know $ doesn't grow on trees but maybe save a little here and there and get him a watch for a wedding gift and also a simple band for the ceremony. He could wear a proper fitting ring on his right hand during the ceremony. It doesn't have to be on his left hand to be meaningful. But yes no rings around machinery! Very dangerous! P.S. We are honoring our children in ceremony with a watch and a bracelet everybody gonna get a watch! Haha<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI love that you're honoring your children during your ceremony! absolutely love it!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80f8fd7409fe659403cf91c4b55a2124","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I was thinking putting it on the right hand could be a way out and it will still look nice during the ceremony. My fiance doesn&#039;t like wearing rings either so we are considering the idea of getting a chain for him to wear it around his neck haha, Frodo style :P.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887885,"PostDate":1425218268,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was thinking putting it on the right hand could be a way out and it will still look nice during the ceremony. My fiance doesn't like wearing rings either so we are considering the idea of getting a chain for him to wear it around his neck haha, Frodo style <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29a40f360febfe801aa063d6786ec1d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] Your nerdiness is showing!&amp;nbsp; :P&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Muhahahah he&#039;s in trouble now!&amp;nbsp; I just googled \"hinged rings\" and this IS a thing!&amp;nbsp; Okay, so this one is $2000 and probably not the best investment considering.&amp;nbsp; But it&#039;s good to know such a thing exists.&amp;nbsp; I just have to find a reasonable one now and figure out what size his finger is... somehow...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/store.superfitinc.com\/images\/product\/bevel%20109%20main2.jpg\" alt=\"bevel%20109%20main2.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887886,"PostDate":1425219034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> Your nerdiness is showing!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Muhahahah he's in trouble now!\u00a0 I just googled \"hinged rings\" and this IS a thing!\u00a0 Okay, so this one is $2000 and probably not the best investment considering.\u00a0 But it's good to know such a thing exists.\u00a0 I just have to find a reasonable one now and figure out what size his finger is... somehow...<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/store.superfitinc.com\/images\/product\/bevel%20109%20main2.jpg\" alt=\"bevel%20109%20main2.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424042509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1435421499","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"78864","Title":"Ring-Proof Ring Finger","LastPostDate":1434118030},"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
