{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9610c6d7e8d2c15cc30db6e6dae29591","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;those rings are awesome!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887887,"PostDate":1425219980,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>those rings are awesome!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.53.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb47f971f441f98ebb8d189fe9ff6124","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1887883\" timestamp=\"1425232234\"]\nI love that you&#039;re honoring your children during your ceremony! absolutely love it!!![\/quote]\nHey thanks mama! Skipped sand ceremony and wanted the children to be incorporated. My officiant, Petra Rattue (amazing) even incorporated a short little fictional story about family and team work towards the end of our ceremony!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887890,"PostDate":1425221642,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 01 March 2015 - 01:50 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I love that you're honoring your children during your ceremony! absolutely love it!!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHey thanks mama! Skipped sand ceremony and wanted the children to be incorporated. My officiant, Petra Rattue (amazing) even incorporated a short little fictional story about family and team work towards the end of our ceremony! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401122033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.195.165.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1434104702,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90f53c4ab1999c60352f804e214dff18","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;FI is a \"automotive collision repair tech\" -- he fixes wrecked cars and he hates when I say mechanic-because he&#039;s not. &amp;nbsp;But anyway. &amp;nbsp;He&#039;s also a volunteer firefighter. &amp;nbsp;Needless to say, daily wear of a ring is impracticable and dangerous. &amp;nbsp;So he came up with the idea that he would get a \"nice\" ring for weekends or when we go to weddings, fancy stuff. &amp;nbsp;Then, he is getting silicone bands to wear daily which I never knew existed, he found them! Look at him all determined to wear a ring. &amp;nbsp;Anywho They&#039;re like those livestrong bracelets they sell and they are like $20. &amp;nbsp;They&#039;re designed to break under 40lbs of pressure so if it get stuck on something it will snap much faster than his finger will break. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/dp\/B00OBT4HV4\/ref=twister_B00OBT4IAO&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/dp\/B00OBT4HV4\/ref=twister_B00OBT4IAO&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also found this which is pretty cool. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s for when&amp;nbsp;your knuckles are much bigger than the top of the finger :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.fastcodesign.com\/3030074\/a-safer-wedding-band-for-active-husbands?utm_source=facebook&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.fastcodesign.com\/3030074\/a-safer-wedding-band-for-active-husbands?utm_source=facebook&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898448,"PostDate":1434104684,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>FI is a \"automotive collision repair tech\" -- he fixes wrecked cars and he hates when I say mechanic-because he's not. \u00a0But anyway. \u00a0He's also a volunteer firefighter. \u00a0Needless to say, daily wear of a ring is impracticable and dangerous. \u00a0So he came up with the idea that he would get a \"nice\" ring for weekends or when we go to weddings, fancy stuff. \u00a0Then, he is getting silicone bands to wear daily which I never knew existed, he found them! Look at him all determined to wear a ring. \u00a0Anywho They're like those livestrong bracelets they sell and they are like $20. \u00a0They're designed to break under 40lbs of pressure so if it get stuck on something it will snap much faster than his finger will break. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.amazon.com\/dp\/B00OBT4HV4\/ref=twister_B00OBT4IAO' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amazon.co...ster_B00OBT4IAO<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also found this which is pretty cool. \u00a0It's for when\u00a0your knuckles are much bigger than the top of the finger <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.fastcodesign.com\/3030074\/a-safer-wedding-band-for-active-husbands?utm_source=facebook' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.fastcodes...source=facebook<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andreapurcell1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.174.154.76","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428250857,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282640.png?_r=1433807300","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"andreapurcell1","Id":282640,"Name":"andreapurcell1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.158.93.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1434106237,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0495bb404de66fcd76fb631306788705","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have a QALO (Quality . Athletics . Love . Outdoors) ring for when I&#039;m working out and lifting weights. Might even use it when hiking or doing something where I don&#039;t want my shiny ring to get dirty. They are silicone rings and some of the rings are in support of different things like lupus or breast cancer and so much of the proceeds go to these charities and what not. They are for both men and women and come in so many colors! \n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/qalo.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/qalo.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898453,"PostDate":1434106102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have a QALO (Quality . Athletics . Love . Outdoors) ring for when I'm working out and lifting weights. Might even use it when hiking or doing something where I don't want my shiny ring to get dirty. They are silicone rings and some of the rings are in support of different things like lupus or breast cancer and so much of the proceeds go to these charities and what not. They are for both men and women and come in so many colors! <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1898453]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283167-143412045907.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1434120457.808320.jpg -  349.16KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283167-143412045907.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1434120457.808320.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/qalo.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/qalo.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432086904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.149.182.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1434117215,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85e5bd5f86e321aa7adfa156ea8b4a92","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"yycbride2016\"] this is so cool!! I love this idea. I&#039;m looking at the website right now. My fiance does a lot of construction so this would be great!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898468,"PostDate":1434117060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283167\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/283167-yycbride2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">yycbride2016<\/span><\/a> this is so cool!! I love this idea. I'm looking at the website right now. My fiance does a lot of construction so this would be great!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415533111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.56.86.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"145985b28173ced44333d1aba14ae72b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"snswedding2016\"] This would be a great thing for him then! I love wearing mine when i&#039;m working out. I usually feel naked without my e-ring now so I have to have something on at all times haha. My fiance thinks its silly that I got one, but he might not think its silly once he has a nice ring to wear and doesn&#039;t want to ruin it.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898469,"PostDate":1434117190,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> This would be a great thing for him then! I love wearing mine when i'm working out. I usually feel naked without my e-ring now so I have to have something on at all times haha. My fiance thinks its silly that I got one, but he might not think its silly once he has a nice ring to wear and doesn't want to ruin it.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432086904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.149.182.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78864,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c976450c878d0d2cdac3326d7c0d23a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"yycbride2016\"] I just called my fiance about it and he&#039;s pretty excited, he was like \"sold! Get it!\" lol! I&#039;m going to get one too. I take my ring off a lot (doing housework, helping my fiance with renovations etc.) and I agree with you I feel very naked without a ring now, so this will be a nice replacement.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898471,"PostDate":1434118030,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283167\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/283167-yycbride2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">yycbride2016<\/span><\/a> I just called my fiance about it and he's pretty excited, he was like \"sold! Get it!\" lol! I'm going to get one too. I take my ring off a lot (doing housework, helping my fiance with renovations etc.) and I agree with you I feel very naked without a ring now, so this will be a nice replacement.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1415533111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
