great on!","Attachments":[],"Id":1119109,"PostDate":1271654223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>skadow<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I looked at the yummy tummy site. There are defently some cute \/ classy looking intimates that will help keep everything flat. My dress will show any bumps.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.yummietummie.com\/teddie.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Teddie<\/a><br \/> <br \/> This one looks nice and sexy<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>LOL that is so funny..that is one of the ones my MOH gave me! I LOVE it it is super cute on and it holds you great. It doesn't hold half as well as the VS thong shaper though, but it feels great on!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/vdaybrides-planning-thread-warning-pics-galore-54918\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/vdaybrides-dreams-los-cabos-wedding-review-long-55501\/'>My Dreams Los Cabos Review<\/a><\/div>\n<div><span>Married 2-14-2010 Dreams, Los Cabos<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","Email":"itherapysolutions@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1256431394,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222825.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vdaybride","Id":222825,"Name":"vdaybride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50895,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0cfb8f67bead101b83b7db2ef1215906","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;vdaybride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I ended up wearing a yummy tummy that my MOH gave me for the next day pics. It smoothed me out and felt soooo good against my skil. For the wedding, I wore the Victoria secret thong shaper. THose things will smooth out whatever you want them to! Belly button, curves, lungs! Surprisingly, they were not uncomfortable at all. I am usually a 6-8 in most things and I purchased the small and it did the trick! Highly recommended&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I can&#039;t find the thong shaper, but do you recommend the shapewear by VS? I tried the spanx and they did nothing for me. Have you compared the shapewear to spanx? I am wanting to wear the high waist thigh slimmer under my dress. I will change into something more sexy by the end of the night.","Attachments":[],"Id":1119150,"PostDate":1271675189,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>vdaybride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I ended up wearing a yummy tummy that my MOH gave me for the next day pics. It smoothed me out and felt soooo good against my skil. For the wedding, I wore the Victoria secret thong shaper. THose things will smooth out whatever you want them to! Belly button, curves, lungs! Surprisingly, they were not uncomfortable at all. I am usually a 6-8 in most things and I purchased the small and it did the trick! Highly recommended<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I can't find the thong shaper, but do you recommend the shapewear by VS? I tried the spanx and they did nothing for me. Have you compared the shapewear to spanx? I am wanting to wear the high waist thigh slimmer under my dress. I will change into something more sexy by the end of the night.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/meredithandjedd.com\">My Planning Site<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wqxRY9P\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...Y9P\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><\/strong><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/jk46iybq93.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/jk46iybq93.png<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"meredithhaley@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1264175810,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224948.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":73,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mere","Id":224948,"Name":"Mere","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50895,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f32cd9e0cc57ff60682e61be6387174","RawContent":"I too will try th VS thong shaper! I am a 6\/8 but my dress is chiffon and clingy so will show any &amp;quot;imperfections&amp;quot; that I may have. I would much rather be smooth underneath.","Attachments":[],"Id":1119247,"PostDate":1271683277,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I too will try th VS thong shaper! I am a 6\/8 but my dress is chiffon and clingy so will show any \"imperfections\" that I may have. I would much rather be smooth underneath.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"questle.khalia314@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1262139431,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224186.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Diva","Id":224186,"Name":"Diva","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50895,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f5143f46a25203fddf86c495e256184","RawContent":"Vday: did you have any issues with the thong shaper rolling down at the top? I tried the Spanx Higher Power one time and it kept rolling down! It was soo annoying! Since there is nothing to hook the VS one to at the top, I wanted to know if you had this issue.\n \n Thanks :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1119262,"PostDate":1271683867,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Vday: did you have any issues with the thong shaper rolling down at the top? I tried the Spanx Higher Power one time and it kept rolling down! It was soo annoying! Since there is nothing to hook the VS one to at the top, I wanted to know if you had this issue.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"questle.khalia314@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1262139431,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224186.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Diva","Id":224186,"Name":"Diva","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50895,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19f6d6b765e3cec37b1853dced987998","RawContent":"as far as corsets I was thinking of getting something from Fredericks of Hollywood...they have extremely sexy undergarments. lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1119273,"PostDate":1271684265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                as far as corsets I was thinking of getting something from Fredericks of Hollywood...they have extremely sexy undergarments. lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/tiffanyandjasonforever\/\">Our Wedding Page<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mischaka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1263703588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224768.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mischaka","Id":224768,"Name":"Mischaka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50895,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26b9c645b1863c3783115d4509f3434e","RawContent":"No bra, it&#039;s built in (double cups ) lol\n \n But my mom just got me a lacey white thong from GAP Body and it is Soooooo comfortable.\n \n My FMIL bought me lace boy shorts that say &amp;quot;I DO&amp;quot;, but my SIL said (on here day back in October) she took them off at the reception because they kept riding up and she couldn&#039;t pick her wedge with all that dress lol\n \n Therefore, I am opting for the thongs.","Attachments":[],"Id":1119352,"PostDate":1271687897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                No bra, it's built in (double cups ) lol<br \/> <br \/> But my mom just got me a lacey white thong from GAP Body and it is Soooooo comfortable.<br \/> <br \/> My FMIL bought me lace boy shorts that say \"I DO\", but my SIL said (on here day back in October) she took them off at the reception because they kept riding up and she couldn't pick her wedge with all that dress lol<br \/> <br \/> Therefore, I am opting for the thongs.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Shannon<\/strong><\/i><br><br><span>YEAH---We Did It!