.bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am too in the market for something in my area. I went to a very well known store in the Northern VA area. I did not like it because the customer service <br \/> SUCKED! <br \/> <br \/> I would like to wear there navy blue Hanky Panky's that I have seen. I still have some time to look for the bra or corset. That night I would like a very nice garter with stockings.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"royalty117@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268151511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226286.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PrincssScorpion7","Id":226286,"Name":"PrincssScorpion7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":50895,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f113cde86f153f0a128d4ef978dced54","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;vdaybride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;LOL that is so funny..that is one of the ones my MOH gave me! I LOVE it it is super cute on and it holds you great. It doesn&#039;t hold half as well as the VS thong shaper though, but it feels great on!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;My only consern with it is it looks like it is a one piece. Going to the restroom would be a real pain with that and the wedding dress.","Attachments":[],"Id":1119775,"PostDate":1271702907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>vdaybride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">LOL that is so funny..that is one of the ones my MOH gave me! I LOVE it it is super cute on and it holds you great. It doesn't hold half as well as the VS thong shaper though, but it feels great on!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>My only consern with it is it looks like it is a one piece. Going to the restroom would be a real pain with that and the wedding dress.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarakadow@yaho.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1265430469,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225370.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":129,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skadow","Id":225370,"Name":"skadow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":50895,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7dd48596312fa762671f721b0fcf2b25","RawContent":"i had purchased a push-up corset bra back in december but it absolutely vanished and has not resurfaced! i leave in 3 weeks, so it&#039;s time to re-purchase. i&#039;m looking for something that will hold up the girls (c-d). the corset bra definitely did this, but it didn&#039;t flatten in the belly area at all. i&#039;m a size 2, so i don&#039;t need much, but just want a little bit of help. any suggestions, ladies? can i find this in one piece, or do i need two separate pieces?","Attachments":[],"Id":1119863,"PostDate":1271704596,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i had purchased a push-up corset bra back in december but it absolutely vanished and has not resurfaced! i leave in 3 weeks, so it's time to re-purchase. i'm looking for something that will hold up the girls (c-d). the corset bra definitely did this, but it didn't flatten in the belly area at all. i'm a size 2, so i don't need much, but just want a little bit of help. any suggestions, ladies? can i find this in one piece, or do i need two separate pieces?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i707.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww75\/dipics\/065copy-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i707.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...\/065copy-1.jpg<\/a><br><span>and happily ever after begins...<\/span><br><br><br><span>wedding review (the royal and the gran porto real, playa del carmen)<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/royal-gran-porto-real-wedding-review-long-59649\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...ew-long-59649\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dpinsk@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1255009527,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222455.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dianep","Id":222455,"Name":"dianep","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":46,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
