 but for the life of me could not remember the name hahA. Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1895341,"PostDate":1430786141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 04 May 2015 - 10:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>There is also a site called preownedweddingdresses.com\u00a0 I have no idea if they charge or what they charge but it's very popular. Might be worth a look.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>that's the one I was thinking of but for the life of me could not remember the name hahA. Thanks!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.164.79.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79108,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ef085b176bdae91f62cf47eb71cd4c3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1895341\" timestamp=\"1430786141\"]\n[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1895336\" timestamp=\"1430793157\"]\nThere is also a site called preownedweddingdresses.com  I have no idea if they charge or what they charge but it&#039;s very popular. Might be worth a look.[\/quote]that&#039;s the one I was thinking of but for the life of me could not remember the name hahA. Thanks![\/quote]it&#039;s the one I&#039;m creeping right now.  since Doug asked me to try to bring down the dress cost I&#039;m still in the hunt. they have one of the dresses on my wish list but it still isn&#039;t in yet. should be this week. once I find out the pricing I&#039;ll decide if I go with it or not. it&#039;s something I want off the to do list!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1895343,"PostDate":1430812830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 04 May 2015 - 08:35 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><\/p><blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"acw271011\" data-cid=\"1895336\" data-time=\"1430793157\"><p>\nThere is also a site called preownedweddingdresses.com  I have no idea if they charge or what they charge but it's very popular. Might be worth a look.<\/p><\/div><\/div>that's the one I was thinking of but for the life of me could not remember the name hahA. Thanks!<\/blockquote>\n<br>\nit's the one I'm creeping right now.  since Doug asked me to try to bring down the dress cost I'm still in the hunt. they have one of the dresses on my wish list but it still isn't in yet. should be this week. once I find out the pricing I'll decide if I go with it or not. it's something I want off the to do list!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79108","Title":"Where To Sell Bridal Gown?","LastPostDate":1430812830},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
