{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.47.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78522,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9752d1b0de9d498ef09dd7ed3f0aad34","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"beckys98\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wow!!! That dress is&amp;nbsp;gorgeous!The sample fits you like a glove! Don&#039;t worry about the no make up, you look great..you don&#039;t need it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I see what you mean about the&amp;nbsp;shininess, must of been the flash....it doesn&#039;t look shiny on her website.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So what kind of shoes are you thinking about getting? I know you were thinking of flats but then you sent me the pic of those strappy heals...are you getting married on the beach?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891996,"PostDate":1428331420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wow!!! That dress is\u00a0gorgeous!The sample fits you like a glove! Don't worry about the no make up, you look great..you don't need it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I see what you mean about the\u00a0shininess, must of been the flash....it doesn't look shiny on her website.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So what kind of shoes are you thinking about getting? I know you were thinking of flats but then you sent me the pic of those strappy heals...are you getting married on the beach?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78522,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bcd8c96750c1d5125c1f913992b371fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love the first dress and I agree.. the back on the first dress is a bit nicer.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891997,"PostDate":1428331520,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love the first dress and I agree.. the back on the first dress is a bit nicer.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.110.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78522,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca9fe366d016412a3e10032377482ccd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Meandhim\"] Thanks! I&#039;m small on top so they essentially are making me a dress with a small top and a medium bottom, so I&#039;m hoping the only alterations I&#039;ll need are getting it hemmed and putting in a bustle.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our ceremony will be on the beach and then reception will be indoors. I KNOW that flats are the rational choice since I&#039;ll be barefoot for the ceremony (I got some barefoot sandals on Etsy) and then I will want flats later when I&#039;m dancing. Plus no one will see them anyway, but it is hard to picture such a fancy dress with a flat that I would wear on a normal day. Plus my fiance is tall. I need to figure it out for my alterations appointment on 4\/18 for the hem!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I definitely prefer a sandal and would love something with a strap across the toes and the ankle, versus a t-strap or flip flop (like the Payless ones I showed you). But I also ordered these to try because I like the color. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.dillards.com\/product\/Gianni-Bini-Roycee-Jeweled-Sandals_301_-1_301_504890211?df=04375309_zi_mint_to_be&amp;amp;categoryId=456289&amp;amp;scrollTop=0&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.dillards.com\/product\/Gianni-Bini-Roycee-Jeweled-Sandals_301_-1_301_504890211?df=04375309_zi_mint_to_be&amp;amp;categoryId=456289&amp;amp;scrollTop=0&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is weird the things I&#039;ve been indecisive about that I never thought I would be. This is one!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892008,"PostDate":1428332545,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/268499-meandhim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Meandhim<\/span><\/a> Thanks! I'm small on top so they essentially are making me a dress with a small top and a medium bottom, so I'm hoping the only alterations I'll need are getting it hemmed and putting in a bustle.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our ceremony will be on the beach and then reception will be indoors. I KNOW that flats are the rational choice since I'll be barefoot for the ceremony (I got some barefoot sandals on Etsy) and then I will want flats later when I'm dancing. Plus no one will see them anyway, but it is hard to picture such a fancy dress with a flat that I would wear on a normal day. Plus my fiance is tall. I need to figure it out for my alterations appointment on 4\/18 for the hem!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I definitely prefer a sandal and would love something with a strap across the toes and the ankle, versus a t-strap or flip flop (like the Payless ones I showed you). But I also ordered these to try because I like the color. <a href='http:\/\/www.dillards.com\/product\/Gianni-Bini-Roycee-Jeweled-Sandals_301_-1_301_504890211?df=04375309_zi_mint_to_be&categoryId=456289&scrollTop=0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dillards....289&scrollTop=0<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is weird the things I've been indecisive about that I never thought I would be. This is one!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.47.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78522,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"657452efedaa374a63fe878d934dc303","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Those are pretty too! I love that color! I never wear heals so flats are my everyday choice and that&#039;s why I wanted them to be a little bit more special. It&#039;s hard to find something simple yet special....thank god for you! You really saved me! What are the colors of you wedding? Are you more of a silver or gold person? &amp;nbsp;I will keep my eye out for shoes for you!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yeah there are so many things I&#039;ve come&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;now that I thought I would never care about before either!! lol! like shoes! Jewellery is another one! I find all the wedding&amp;nbsp;jewellery is very fancy and blingy...I&#039;m not fancy or blingy lol. Its looks great but because Im not used to it I&#039;m just too uncomfortable wearing it. What are you doing for jewellery?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892016,"PostDate":1428334155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Those are pretty too! I love that color! I never wear heals so flats are my everyday choice and that's why I wanted them to be a little bit more special. It's hard to find something simple yet special....thank god for you! You really saved me! What are the colors of you wedding? Are you more of a silver or gold person? \u00a0I will keep my eye out for shoes for you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yeah there are so many things I've come\u00a0across\u00a0now that I thought I would never care about before either!! lol! like shoes! Jewellery is another one! I find all the wedding\u00a0jewellery is very fancy and blingy...I'm not fancy or blingy lol. Its looks great but because Im not used to it I'm just too uncomfortable wearing it. What are you doing for jewellery?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.78.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78522,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c91cb03a443e89f94f8147d0f4bcd1e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I agree on the jewelry too! Some of it feels too fancy for the beach. I guess that is my problem in a nutshell - finding the right level of fanciness for pretty much everything. I want to be beachy and relaxed, but it is still my wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our colors are turquoise and royal blue - the colors of the water! I&#039;m going with silver, I think primarily because I found this cute comb for my hair. I&#039;m not wearing a veil and we&#039;re using starfish on a lot of our stuff (the resort logo is a starfish) so I thought this was perfect for my hair.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For earrings I got these with the blue stone, which I still worry is too fancy. But I think that is the only jewelry I&#039;ll wear. I don&#039;t think a necklace will look right, so that makes me feel better about the blingy earrings! I got them on Etsy and they should arrive this week.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll probably skip a bracelet too, just because I don&#039;t feel like I need it! If I do a bracelet it&#039;ll be really simple.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is hard to picture it all when you don&#039;t have your dress either! I hope when I pull it all together that it looks like I envision, but it is so hard to tell :unsure:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":31460,"Name":"hair pin.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-278581-0-84833100-1428349122.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-278581-0-84833100-1428349122_thumb.jpg","Width":570,"Height":570},{"Id":31461,"Name":"earrings.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-278581-0-60478600-1428349138.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-278581-0-60478600-1428349138_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":662}],"Id":1892030,"PostDate":1428335316,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I agree on the jewelry too! Some of it feels too fancy for the beach. I guess that is my problem in a nutshell - finding the right level of fanciness for pretty much everything. I want to be beachy and relaxed, but it is still my wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our colors are turquoise and royal blue - the colors of the water! I'm going with silver, I think primarily because I found this cute comb for my hair. I'm not wearing a veil and we're using starfish on a lot of our stuff (the resort logo is a starfish) so I thought this was perfect for my hair.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For earrings I got these with the blue stone, which I still worry is too fancy. But I think that is the only jewelry I'll wear. I don't think a necklace will look right, so that makes me feel better about the blingy earrings! I got them on Etsy and they should arrive this week.\u00a0 I'll probably skip a bracelet too, just because I don't feel like I need it! If I do a bracelet it'll be really simple.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is hard to picture it all when you don't have your dress either! I hope when I pull it all together that it looks like I envision, but it is so hard to tell <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78522,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a2070ad4273dc37aad8d36e0a80ddd4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beckys98\" post=\"1892008\" timestamp=\"1428346945\"]\n@[member=\"Meandhim\"] Thanks! I&#039;m small on top so they essentially are making me a dress with a small top and a medium bottom, so I&#039;m hoping the only alterations I&#039;ll need are getting it hemmed and putting in a bustle.\n\nOur ceremony will be on the beach and then reception will be indoors. I KNOW that flats are the rational choice since I&#039;ll be barefoot for the ceremony (I got some barefoot sandals on Etsy) and then I will want flats later when I&#039;m dancing. Plus no one will see them anyway, but it is hard to picture such a fancy dress with a flat that I would wear on a normal day. Plus my fiance is tall. I need to figure it out for my alterations appointment on 4\/18 for the hem!\n\nI definitely prefer a sandal and would love something with a strap across the toes and the ankle, versus a t-strap or flip flop (like the Payless ones I showed you). But I also ordered these to try because I like the color. [url=\"http:\/\/www.dillards.com\/product\/Gianni-Bini-Roycee-Jeweled-Sandals_301_-1_301_504890211?df=04375309_zi_mint_to_be&amp;amp;categoryId=456289&amp;amp;scrollTop=0\"]http:\/\/www.dillards.com\/product\/Gianni-Bini-Roycee-Jeweled-Sandals_301_-1_301_504890211?df=04375309_zi_mint_to_be&amp;amp;categoryId=456289&amp;amp;scrollTop=0[\/url]\n\nIt is weird the things I&#039;ve been indecisive about that I never thought I would be. This is one![\/quote]Those are perfect!! I almost did something similar!!  Just remember that no one sees your feet so wear what you want and are comfortable in :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1892075,"PostDate":1428349429,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 06 April 2015 - 03:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/268499-meandhim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Meandhim<\/span><\/a> Thanks! I'm small on top so they essentially are making me a dress with a small top and a medium bottom, so I'm hoping the only alterations I'll need are getting it hemmed and putting in a bustle.<br><br>\nOur ceremony will be on the beach and then reception will be indoors. I KNOW that flats are the rational choice since I'll be barefoot for the ceremony (I got some barefoot sandals on Etsy) and then I will want flats later when I'm dancing. Plus no one will see them anyway, but it is hard to picture such a fancy dress with a flat that I would wear on a normal day. Plus my fiance is tall. I need to figure it out for my alterations appointment on 4\/18 for the hem!<br><br>\nI definitely prefer a sandal and would love something with a strap across the toes and the ankle, versus a t-strap or flip flop (like the Payless ones I showed you). But I also ordered these to try because I like the color. <a href='http:\/\/www.dillards.com\/product\/Gianni-Bini-Roycee-Jeweled-Sandals_301_-1_301_504890211?df=04375309_zi_mint_to_be&categoryId=456289&scrollTop=0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dillards....289&scrollTop=0<\/a><br><br>\nIt is weird the things I've been indecisive about that I never thought I would be. This is one!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThose are perfect!! I almost did something similar!!  Just remember that no one sees your feet so wear what you want and are comfortable in <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.229.149.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78522,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c39189d82c17c18785f8def70104e16c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I know i&#039;m a little late to this thread, but you should be glad you didn&#039;t buy the second dress. &amp;nbsp;I have a body type similar to yours and I tried that on. &amp;nbsp;I thought it was cut in all the wrong places and the satin finish made it look cheap. &amp;nbsp;(sorry if someone else on here bought it, but it just wasn&#039;t my style). &amp;nbsp;The dress you bought is beautiful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;on a separate note, I&#039;ve seen some very dressy brides on beaches, and they still look fantastic. &amp;nbsp;I wouldn&#039;t worry too much about a little bling.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894143,"PostDate":1429823445,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I know i'm a little late to this thread, but you should be glad you didn't buy the second dress. \u00a0I have a body type similar to yours and I tried that on. \u00a0I thought it was cut in all the wrong places and the satin finish made it look cheap. \u00a0(sorry if someone else on here bought it, but it just wasn't my style). \u00a0The dress you bought is beautiful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>on a separate note, I've seen some very dressy brides on beaches, and they still look fantastic. \u00a0I wouldn't worry too much about a little bling.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread: \u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79284-leighcs-planning-thread-april-9-2016\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79284-leighcs-planning-thread-april-9-2016\/<\/a>","Email":"lcampbe8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.250.56.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424787862,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LeighC","Id":282234,"Name":"LeighC","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
