Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":385,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1891762,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1428053438,"LastPoster":{"Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":33,"Preview":{"Id":1891762,"PostDate":1428053438,"PostContent":"Hello ladies!  Just thought I would share a post of how I made my brooch bouquet; since I've had...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"478a40d2f8c27287f86d5ed62afe5f6d","RawContent":"Hello ladies! \n\n\nJust thought I would share a post of how I made my brooch bouquet; since I&#039;ve had some interest [emoji4]\n\n\nFirst I went to Michael&#039;s and bought an angled foam holder with plastic handle, just so it was easier to decide the shape! \n\n\n\n\n\nI then picked on of my bigger pieces to start with and build around; I tested each piece before I secured it to make sure I like how it looked [emoji38]\n\n\n\n\n\nFrom there I just moved out adding pieces here and there; sometimes filling gaps with smaller pieces! \n\n\n\n\n\nI added the ivory flowers to add the ivory from my dress. Didn&#039;t put too many in since it is a brooch bouquet lol! \n\n\n\n\n\nI then added dangling beads as well as the fake purple flowers in behind to hide all the wire [emoji4]\n\n\n\n\n\nI then added the ribbon around the bottom to hide all wires and to finish it off (the beads are hanging sideways because it is on its side haha) [emoji5]\ufe0f\n\n\n\n\n\nP.S I pre wired everything before I started putting it all together! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891762,"PostDate":1428053438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies! <br><br>\nJust thought I would share a post of how I made my brooch bouquet; since I've had some interest [emoji4]<br><br>\nFirst I went to Michael's and bought an angled foam holder with plastic handle, just so it was easier to decide the shape! <br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806723813.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067236.851587.jpg - Size: 151.05KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806723813.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067236.851587.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nI then picked on of my bigger pieces to start with and build around; I tested each piece before I secured it to make sure I like how it looked [emoji38]<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806726206.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067258.661855.jpg - Size: 200.6KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806726206.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067258.661855.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806727678.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067274.632147.jpg - Size: 285.16KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806727678.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067274.632147.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806729293.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067291.941120.jpg - Size: 345.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806729293.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067291.941120.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806730652.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067305.533980.jpg - Size: 204.38KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806730652.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067305.533980.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nFrom there I just moved out adding pieces here and there; sometimes filling gaps with smaller pieces! <br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806736825.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067365.096743.jpg - Size: 218.16KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806736825.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067365.096743.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806738394.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067381.402600.jpg - Size: 229.03KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806738394.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067381.402600.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806740305.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067401.145796.jpg - Size: 290.65KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806740305.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067401.145796.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806741895.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067417.575171.jpg - Size: 214.42KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806741895.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067417.575171.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nI added the ivory flowers to add the ivory from my dress. Didn't put too many in since it is a brooch bouquet lol! <br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-1428067476.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067473.827700.jpg - Size: 217.87KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-1428067476.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067473.827700.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806751299.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067511.866013.jpg - Size: 225.22KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806751299.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067511.866013.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806753203.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067530.223009.jpg - Size: 258.54KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806753203.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067530.223009.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806754711.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067546.197631.jpg - Size: 364.66KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806754711.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067546.197631.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nI then added dangling beads as well as the fake purple flowers in behind to hide all the wire [emoji4]<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806761003.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067608.724235.jpg - Size: 419.45KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806761003.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067608.724235.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-1428067622.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067620.846995.jpg - Size: 336.71KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-1428067622.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067620.846995.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806764109.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067635.371710.jpg - Size: 327.65KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806764109.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067635.371710.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806765419.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067652.596887.jpg - Size: 353.89KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806765419.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067652.596887.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806766582.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067664.169074.jpg - Size: 314.72KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806766582.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067664.169074.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806767718.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067676.158695.jpg - Size: 320.18KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806767718.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067676.158695.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nI then added the ribbon around the bottom to hide all wires and to finish it off (the beads are hanging sideways because it is on its side haha) [emoji5]\ufe0f<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806774933.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067747.227430.jpg - Size: 270.18KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806774933.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067747.227430.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806776303.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067761.718490.jpg - Size: 280.15KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806776303.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067761.718490.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891762]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806777573.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067773.385986.jpg - Size: 236.63KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806777573.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428067773.385986.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nP.S I pre wired everything before I started putting it all together! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60005bf58af1304afafe4698ce82e982","RawContent":"\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891768,"PostDate":1428055554,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891768]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806989694.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428069894.178335.jpg - Size: 335.43KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806989694.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428069894.178335.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891768]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-14280699144.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428069912.203364.jpg - Size: 265.17KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-14280699144.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428069912.203364.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891768]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806992818.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428069925.679129.jpg - Size: 265.17KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142806992818.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428069925.679129.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891768]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-14280699523.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428069950.624012.jpg - Size: 320.45KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-14280699523.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1428069950.624012.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.175.124.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d41069e4aa5e8a45db9f28c58309c2cc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s another beautiful option one of our brides chose for her &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding&lt;\/a&gt; shown here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1402860_10151930922174487_571284223_o.jpg\" alt=\"1402860_10151930922174487_571284223_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing everyone all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891779,"PostDate":1428065435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here's another beautiful option one of our brides chose for her <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding<\/a> shown here:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1402860_10151930922174487_571284223_o.jpg\" alt=\"1402860_10151930922174487_571284223_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing everyone all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2d23a491e9dc08bd0a0176cccf7b38e","RawContent":"I was totally wondering how you made it! Haha thanks for posting :) \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891792,"PostDate":1428085421,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was totally wondering how you made it! Haha thanks for posting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"104110d6c789b139a767af4fbc60bab4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1891792\" timestamp=\"1428099821\"]\nI was totally wondering how you made it! Haha thanks for posting :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]No problem! I&#039;ve had a few ladies ask so I thought I would try my best to help [emoji4] I wish I took more pictures during the beginning to show more but I got too caught up in building it [emoji38] @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891808,"PostDate":1428099885,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 03 April 2015 - 06:23 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I was totally wondering how you made it! Haha thanks for posting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nNo problem! I've had a few ladies ask so I thought I would try my best to help [emoji4] I wish I took more pictures during the beginning to show more but I got too caught up in building it [emoji38] @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.109.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0a5f616f401d2b09ff2f91caf629a0d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"IzzyDeee\"] thanks for posting and for messaging me back! I think I may take this approach this time. &amp;nbsp;Mine looked more like the moments that matter post but the colours were white and aqua (which I love BUT now that my dress is gold and ivory...it doesn&#039;t really go well) &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891814,"PostDate":1428137061,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282430\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282430-izzydeee\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">IzzyDeee<\/span><\/a> thanks for posting and for messaging me back! I think I may take this approach this time. \u00a0Mine looked more like the moments that matter post but the colours were white and aqua (which I love BUT now that my dress is gold and ivory...it doesn't really go well) \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stimaberry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.212.163.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410080121,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingerBride","Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79015,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ade51d4d844eab3e1e35096e8ddb3b45","RawContent":"[quote name=\"GingerBride\" post=\"1891814\" timestamp=\"1428151461\"]\n@[member=\"IzzyDeee\"] thanks for posting and for messaging me back! I think I may take this approach this time.  Mine looked more like the moments that matter post but the colours were white and aqua (which I love BUT now that my dress is gold and ivory...it doesn&#039;t really go well)[\/quote]Just happy to be able to help [emoji1] @[member=\"GingerBride\"] just remember it&#039;s fine to have silver pieces, just make sure you mix gold in there with them to balance that out! [emoji4]\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891815,"PostDate":1428137669,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>GingerBride, on 04 April 2015 - 08:44 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282430\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282430-izzydeee\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">IzzyDeee<\/span><\/a> thanks for posting and for messaging me back! I think I may take this approach this time.  Mine looked more like the moments that matter post but the colours were white and aqua (which I love BUT now that my dress is gold and ivory...it doesn't really go well)<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nJust happy to be able to help [emoji1] @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279720\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279720-gingerbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GingerBride<\/span><\/a> just remember it's fine to have silver pieces, just make sure you mix gold in there with them to balance that out! [emoji4]<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79015","Title":"Diy Brooch Bouquet~ Pointers","LastPostDate":1428137669},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
