e":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a11650b56fc95f0baae54d102be00b96","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It is honestly so pretty!&amp;nbsp; I love this style.&amp;nbsp; I didn&#039;t see that dress when I was at DB.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s so pretty- congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891271,"PostDate":1427715596,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It is honestly so pretty!\u00a0 I love this style.\u00a0 I didn't see that dress when I was at DB.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's so pretty- congrats!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396968452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1435850174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.119.104.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78996,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c0b643d35eb4b469348ee111a3a67d6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"FutureMrsGlover\"] I love it!!!! It looks amazing on you&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891297,"PostDate":1427726806,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277534\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277534-futuremrsglover\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">FutureMrsGlover<\/span><\/a> I love it!!!! It looks amazing on you\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.150.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78996,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ee6e70618d1e5869ef9af10233c842e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsGlover\" post=\"1891197\" timestamp=\"1427656749\"]\nHi Ladies,\n\nI must be the most indecisive bride to be!!!  I have bought and exchanged 3 bridal gowns to date!!!  Well, yesterday I finally found the dress!!!  My first dress was satin and had a bubble hem which I decided I hated, the second was lace but not enough wow factor, the third was satin with bling but very heavy - really loved this one but I know in Jamaica I would sweat to death!!!  So I found myself back in the bridal shop yesterday and I picked out a few dresses and my attendant brought in a new dress that they just got in.  It has everything, it is light, it has a low back, it has lace, tulle and sparkle and is sexy!!!!  I felt amazing and I received so many compliments from the whole store.....my attendant even got the store manager so she could see it on me!!!! \nSo ladies, let me know what you think!!!  I believe I nailed it this time!!!![\/quote]You look amazing!!! That is your dress for sure:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1891323,"PostDate":1427732471,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsGlover, on 29 March 2015 - 03:19 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I must be the most indecisive bride to be!!!\u00a0 I have bought and exchanged 3 bridal gowns to date!!!\u00a0 Well, yesterday I finally found the dress!!!\u00a0 My first dress was satin and had a bubble hem which I decided I hated, the second was lace but not enough wow factor, the third was satin with bling but very heavy - really loved this one but I know in Jamaica I would sweat to death!!!\u00a0 So I found myself back in the bridal shop yesterday and I picked out a few dresses and my attendant brought in a new dress that they just got in.\u00a0 It has everything, it is light, it has a low back, it has lace, tulle\u00a0and sparkle and is sexy!!!!\u00a0 I felt amazing and I received so many compliments from the whole store.....my attendant even got the store manager so she could see it on me!!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So ladies, let me know what you think!!!\u00a0 I believe I nailed it this time!!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>You look amazing!!! That is your dress for sure:)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394118776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.49.89.190","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78996,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by FutureMrsGlover, 30 March 2015 - 06:22 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1427739773,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb05fc51699d2b337646772e9d30143b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@kellymiller- it is a combination&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"pddcmc\"] @[member=\"Meandhim\"] @[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"] Thank you!!&amp;nbsp; I can now actually see myself getting married!&amp;nbsp; I absolutely love it!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"veryvalentine\"]..&amp;nbsp; Thank you! It is a new dress at DB....Galina Signature.&amp;nbsp; I had looked at it online but didn&#039;t think much of it.&amp;nbsp; However, the attendant picked it out for me and it looks very different in person and on than on the website.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891337,"PostDate":1427739721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@kellymiller- it is a combination<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277418\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277418-pddcmc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pddcmc<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"268499\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/268499-meandhim\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Meandhim<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a> Thank you!!\u00a0 I can now actually see myself getting married!\u00a0 I absolutely love it!!!<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277519-veryvalentine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">veryvalentine<\/span><\/a>..\u00a0 Thank you! It is a new dress at DB....Galina Signature.\u00a0 I had looked at it online but didn't think much of it.\u00a0 However, the attendant picked it out for me and it looks very different in person and on than on the website.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397052122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78996,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a556f52bfe6619aa79e6a0d69d4eed54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s so pretty and looks beautiful on you! Congrats on picking one!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891368,"PostDate":1427755914,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That's so pretty and looks beautiful on you! Congrats on picking one!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78996,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c26ddcc8985175fbd89f63099a658ed7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love it! Such a gorgeous dress and it gives you a really nice shape!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891391,"PostDate":1427792797,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love it! Such a gorgeous dress and it gives you a really nice shape!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78996","Title":"Finally!  I Made A Decision On A Dress!","LastPostDate":1427832435},"Pages":{"TotalItems":13,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
